(667200, 69950, 19914, '<td valign="top">Pitty you get it a little out of focus... did you shoot more than one? In this case, I would had shoot 10 ro 20, from the ground looking up, more close, and so on, but if only make a shoot... you bet on a single number!<br/> <br/>A good one could have been shooting to the bollocks from near, in some "strange" point of view that make the subject not inmediately recogniceable ;)</td>', 'Pitty you get it a little out of focus... did you shoot more than one? In this case, I would had shoot 10 ro 20, from the ground looking up, more close, and so on, but if only make a shoot... you bet on a single number! A good one could have been shooting to the bollocks from near, in some "strange" point of view that make the subject not inmediately recogniceable ;)', '2004-04-14 07:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
