(667216, 69839, 19914, '<td valign="top">Try natural daylight, it makes shoots much better in general, in the same way flashes ruin most of the shoots. Combining daylight with some artificial coloured light coming from opposite may also help.<br/> <br/>I think you had problem with insuficient light, as the subject moves a blur a little the photo.<br/> <br/>It is just what I should had tried, but the shoot was nice anyway!</td>', 'Try natural daylight, it makes shoots much better in general, in the same way flashes ruin most of the shoots. Combining daylight with some artificial coloured light coming from opposite may also help. I think you had problem with insuficient light, as the subject moves a blur a little the photo. It is just what I should had tried, but the shoot was nice anyway!', '2004-04-14 07:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
