(667243, 69546, 13035, '<td valign="top">Framed well, and an interesting take on the theme.  I''m confused by the light versus shadow.  Very early morning?  The light crosses the birds at a strange angle.  6</td>', 'Framed well, and an interesting take on the theme.  I''m confused by the light versus shadow.  Very early morning?  The light crosses the birds at a strange angle.  6', '2004-04-14 08:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(667244, 69744, 6025, '<td valign="top">A very good picture technically... The only thing I would point out that there is a difference between "power" and "strength". Power is a more generic term, while strength is a word describing physical attributes such as raw strength and longevity. (you are by no means the only one. Check out this thread: kamps.org/g/?vkmv) I think you picture describes "power", but not "strength", and hence falls outside of the challenge. Sorry. (2)</td>', 'A very good picture technically... The only thing I would point out that there is a difference between "power" and "strength". Power is a more generic term, while strength is a word describing physical attributes such as raw strength and longevity. (you are by no means the only one. Check out this thread: kamps.org/g/?vkmv) I think you picture describes "power", but not "strength", and hence falls outside of the challenge. Sorry. (2)', '2004-04-14 08:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
