(667269, 69217, 6025, '<td valign="top">Hope != strength. Sorry, this image doesn''t work for me. (1)</td>', 'Hope != strength. Sorry, this image doesn''t work for me. (1)', '2004-04-14 08:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(667270, 69517, 6025, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t work for me... It is vastly overexposed, and builds on very subjective connotations of power. Also, I would point out that there is a difference between "power" and "strength". Power is a more generic term, while strength is a word describing physical attributes such as raw strength and longevity. (you are by no means the only one. Check out this thread: kamps.org/g/?vkmv) I think you picture describes "power", but not "strength", and hence falls outside of the challenge. Sorry. (2)</td>', 'This image doesn''t work for me... It is vastly overexposed, and builds on very subjective connotations of power. Also, I would point out that there is a difference between "power" and "strength". Power is a more generic term, while strength is a word describing physical attributes such as raw strength and longevity. (you are by no means the only one. Check out this thread: kamps.org/g/?vkmv) I think you picture describes "power", but not "strength", and hence falls outside of the challenge. Sorry. (2)', '2004-04-14 08:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(667271, 69724, 6025, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would point out that there is a difference between "power" and "strength". Power is a more generic term, while strength is a word describing physical attributes such as raw strength and longevity. (you are by no means the only one. Check out this thread: kamps.org/g/?vkmv) I think you picture describes "power", but not "strength", and hence falls outside of the challenge. Sorry. (2)</td>', 'The only thing I would point out that there is a difference between "power" and "strength". Power is a more generic term, while strength is a word describing physical attributes such as raw strength and longevity. (you are by no means the only one. Check out this thread: kamps.org/g/?vkmv) I think you picture describes "power", but not "strength", and hence falls outside of the challenge. Sorry. (2)', '2004-04-14 08:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(667272, 70059, 6025, '<td valign="top">The image quality is so-so, but the fact that you couldn''t be bothered to turn off the date on your camera fails to impress, I''m afraid. I think it may also be against the challenge rules to have text in your image, but that''s beside the point.</td>', 'The image quality is so-so, but the fact that you couldn''t be bothered to turn off the date on your camera fails to impress, I''m afraid. I think it may also be against the challenge rules to have text in your image, but that''s beside the point.', '2004-04-14 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(667273, 70123, 14202, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, but what is the little dot on the left side halfway down?</td>', 'Great perspective, but what is the little dot on the left side halfway down?', '2004-04-14 08:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(667276, 69043, 6025, '<td valign="top">Hehe.. Cheeky, and a good idea. I like it! (8)</td>', 'Hehe.. Cheeky, and a good idea. I like it! (8)', '2004-04-14 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(667277, 69853, 15832, '<td valign="top">Wow... Excellent momment, Very good exampel of strength.. 9.<br/>My ribbon</td>', 'Wow... Excellent momment, Very good exampel of strength.. 9.My ribbon', '2004-04-14 08:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(667280, 69091, 16126, '<td valign="top">Composition and idea is nice, but it''s very dark. More contrast would have brought out the label while keeping the background dark.</td>', 'Composition and idea is nice, but it''s very dark. More contrast would have brought out the label while keeping the background dark.', '2004-04-14 08:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(667283, 70142, 16126, '<td valign="top">I like the drip on the egg. Composition could be improved by showing more of the top of the hand and/or cropping out the bottom. Pity it''s out of focus (background is sharp!)</td>', 'I like the drip on the egg. Composition could be improved by showing more of the top of the hand and/or cropping out the bottom. Pity it''s out of focus (background is sharp!)', '2004-04-14 08:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(667284, 69853, 6025, '<td valign="top">Spectacular picture! Very, very good. Not sure if it shows strength or technique, but it is definitely very vibrant and "alive". (9)</td>', 'Spectacular picture! Very, very good. Not sure if it shows strength or technique, but it is definitely very vibrant and "alive". (9)', '2004-04-14 08:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(667287, 69981, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very subjective, this one. I don''t think that the US is strong, but it is powerful. Not the same thing. ALso, this image is far too little. (1)</td>', 'Very subjective, this one. I don''t think that the US is strong, but it is powerful. Not the same thing. ALso, this image is far too little. (1)', '2004-04-14 08:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(667288, 69912, 16126, '<td valign="top">I very much like the sepia combined with the lettering on the chairs. Not really convinced that this represents strength, though. 8</td>', 'I very much like the sepia combined with the lettering on the chairs. Not really convinced that this represents strength, though. 8', '2004-04-14 08:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(667289, 69342, 6025, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous dog, too bad it is out of focus :(</td>', 'Gorgeous dog, too bad it is out of focus :(', '2004-04-14 08:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(667292, 70160, 6025, '<td valign="top">I don''t think an underexposed, blurry image of a bookcase filled with random stuff symbolises "strength", I''m afraid. (1)</td>', 'I don''t think an underexposed, blurry image of a bookcase filled with random stuff symbolises "strength", I''m afraid. (1)', '2004-04-14 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(667295, 69738, 6025, '<td valign="top">Hehe. Fantasticly well thought out, and even better executed. The lighting could do with some work, but otherwise nigh-on perfect! (9)</td>', 'Hehe. Fantasticly well thought out, and even better executed. The lighting could do with some work, but otherwise nigh-on perfect! (9)', '2004-04-14 08:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(667296, 70120, 16126, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is strength! Much like the position of the chain in the frame, very good. Could you have avoided the shadows in the foreground and in the upper left corner (different camera position maybe)?</td>', 'Yes, this is strength! Much like the position of the chain in the frame, very good. Could you have avoided the shadows in the foreground and in the upper left corner (different camera position maybe)?', '2004-04-14 08:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(667297, 69258, 15919, '<td valign="top">The idea and the conection to the title is good.  The image it self has a litle dull apearance.  Seems litle underexposed and needs more colorsaturation and contrast.  Maybe better B&amp;W with increast contrast would have been better.</td>', 'The idea and the conection to the title is good.  The image it self has a litle dull apearance.  Seems litle underexposed and needs more colorsaturation and contrast.  Maybe better B&W with increast contrast would have been better.', '2004-04-14 08:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(667299, 69494, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great! Beautiful colors and composition. Would have liked to see a little bit more of the shell, maybe faster shutter?</td>', 'Great! Beautiful colors and composition. Would have liked to see a little bit more of the shell, maybe faster shutter?', '2004-04-14 08:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(667300, 69836, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very subjective judgement of strength. You claim it is "true strength", which is your perogative. I claim it isn''t, and vote 1.</td>', 'Very subjective judgement of strength. You claim it is "true strength", which is your perogative. I claim it isn''t, and vote 1.', '2004-04-14 08:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
