(667349, 70088, 1368, '<td valign="top">Good picture with strong messages! The colors are great the only thing that bugs me is the overexposured part in the topleft corner, other than that Very good - 9</td>', 'Good picture with strong messages! The colors are great the only thing that bugs me is the overexposured part in the topleft corner, other than that Very good - 9', '2004-04-14 09:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(667351, 70063, 14202, '<td valign="top">hmmmmm?</td>', 'hmmmmm?', '2004-04-14 09:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(667352, 69091, 15919, '<td valign="top">Maybe it was ment to look like this but for my opinion I find it underexposed.  The idea is ok though I dont find it very creative.</td>', 'Maybe it was ment to look like this but for my opinion I find it underexposed.  The idea is ok though I dont find it very creative.', '2004-04-14 09:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(667353, 69778, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Amazing shot! - 10</td>', 'Beautiful! Amazing shot! - 10', '2004-04-14 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(667356, 69481, 14805, '<td valign="top">you could have flopped this 180 degrees.  we are trained to look at a flag with the pole on the left.  there is no rule, but it would have been more appealing.</td>', 'you could have flopped this 180 degrees.  we are trained to look at a flag with the pole on the left.  there is no rule, but it would have been more appealing.', '2004-04-14 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(667357, 70067, 14202, '<td valign="top">All the shadow stripes across the page are quite distracting from the point you are portraying</td>', 'All the shadow stripes across the page are quite distracting from the point you are portraying', '2004-04-14 09:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(667358, 69938, 1368, '<td valign="top">Good catch, I see that the lightning was not the best on this day, the white short on the guys are bit overexposured, I feel that it could have been better mabey if you cropped more of the left side, Good luck :)</td>', 'Good catch, I see that the lightning was not the best on this day, the white short on the guys are bit overexposured, I feel that it could have been better mabey if you cropped more of the left side, Good luck :)', '2004-04-14 09:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(667361, 69137, 1368, '<td valign="top">Ok its a picture of a sky a little noisy, the clouds look good , but it kinda looks like a good background, like the subject is missing,  I feel like this picture is screaming for a subject!</td>', 'Ok its a picture of a sky a little noisy, the clouds look good , but it kinda looks like a good background, like the subject is missing,  I feel like this picture is screaming for a subject!', '2004-04-14 09:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(667362, 70141, 15919, '<td valign="top">There is no doubt about the strength.  The image is fine thoug I find the white balance litle to blueish but that´s maybe a good representation of the animals natural inhabitance.  The background is not very interesting so I think you defenitly should have used quite shallower DOF (the focal length must have been long so that wouldn´t have been a problem?) and/or give it tighter croping.  Think increased contrast wouldn´t have hurt.  How about B&amp;W.  But, fine image.</td>', 'There is no doubt about the strength.  The image is fine thoug I find the white balance litle to blueish but that´s maybe a good representation of the animals natural inhabitance.  The background is not very interesting so I think you defenitly should have used quite shallower DOF (the focal length must have been long so that wouldn´t have been a problem?) and/or give it tighter croping.  Think increased contrast wouldn´t have hurt.  How about B&W.  But, fine image.', '2004-04-14 09:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(667363, 69999, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great angle, good lightning and all, Good job :)</td>', 'Great angle, good lightning and all, Good job :)', '2004-04-14 09:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(667367, 70083, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great sky, great colors! My only comment is that I feel there''s a bit too much space on the left, gives a slightly unbalanced feel. 9.</td>', 'Great sky, great colors! My only comment is that I feel there''s a bit too much space on the left, gives a slightly unbalanced feel. 9.', '2004-04-14 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(667369, 69785, 1368, '<td valign="top">I feel like there is a lot of unesesary (cant spell that) space in this picture, I think it could be better if you cropped out the left site after the tree there and the sky just above the clouds, and put  some more contrast in it, with levels and color balance it, it looks just a bit too green/yellow, Good luck :)</td>', 'I feel like there is a lot of unesesary (cant spell that) space in this picture, I think it could be better if you cropped out the left site after the tree there and the sky just above the clouds, and put  some more contrast in it, with levels and color balance it, it looks just a bit too green/yellow, Good luck :)', '2004-04-14 09:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(667373, 70141, 1368, '<td valign="top">Oh my! Is he the cutest thing ever!!  Great picture, could be a little bit sharper, and looks like some parts on the back are a little overexposured, Good luck :)</td>', 'Oh my! Is he the cutest thing ever!!  Great picture, could be a little bit sharper, and looks like some parts on the back are a little overexposured, Good luck :)', '2004-04-14 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(667375, 69750, 1368, '<td valign="top">Thats a good looking fellow ;)  I feel like this picture could mabey have been better in black and white, with some more shadows/contrasts, Good picture though :)</td>', 'Thats a good looking fellow ;)  I feel like this picture could mabey have been better in black and white, with some more shadows/contrasts, Good picture though :)', '2004-04-14 09:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(667380, 69754, 1368, '<td valign="top">I feel like this picture is a bit too grey,  like the lightning could have been better, like sunshine or something, Its kinda flat  like the background needs to seperate more from the subject, The anlge is good and the subject has good contrast, So I guess it the background, not quite sure but Good luck :)</td>', 'I feel like this picture is a bit too grey,  like the lightning could have been better, like sunshine or something, Its kinda flat  like the background needs to seperate more from the subject, The anlge is good and the subject has good contrast, So I guess it the background, not quite sure but Good luck :)', '2004-04-14 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
