(667630, 69853, 17968, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Perfect timing for the shot! How many pictures before you got this one? They usually use a brick for showing the strength, but I guess it''s a melon in this case, or?:-)</td>', 'Great photo! Perfect timing for the shot! How many pictures before you got this one? They usually use a brick for showing the strength, but I guess it''s a melon in this case, or?:-)', '2004-04-14 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(667632, 70062, 16777, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the background is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Good shot, but the background is somewhat distracting.', '2004-04-14 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(667640, 69343, 19901, '<td valign="top">good picture, though I find the Foreground a little distracting.</td>', 'good picture, though I find the Foreground a little distracting.', '2004-04-14 12:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(667641, 69471, 3724, '<td valign="top">An opened bottle.....   you must be familiar with the product.   I like the used quality of this.... not just another product shot.</td>', 'An opened bottle.....   you must be familiar with the product.   I like the used quality of this.... not just another product shot.', '2004-04-14 12:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(667682, 69541, 16595, '<td valign="top">why the thumbnail size?</td>', 'why the thumbnail size?', '2004-04-14 12:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(667684, 68937, 10785, '<td valign="top">A very nice attempt at recreating a classic!<br/>Unfortunately, the drops are deforming...</td>', 'A very nice attempt at recreating a classic!Unfortunately, the drops are deforming...', '2004-04-14 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(667685, 69626, 3724, '<td valign="top">Frame nailer a very powerful tool.   Showing it in someones hand could be an alternative  view that might prove to be interesting.  But this is a still-life -  lighting on this adds drama but I could see a tighter crop.  Spreading the air hose coil around the picture plane might address the spot on center focus of the subject.</td>', 'Frame nailer a very powerful tool.   Showing it in someones hand could be an alternative  view that might prove to be interesting.  But this is a still-life -  lighting on this adds drama but I could see a tighter crop.  Spreading the air hose coil around the picture plane might address the spot on center focus of the subject.', '2004-04-14 12:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(667686, 70133, 17967, '<td valign="top">Very original!!!!</td>', 'Very original!!!!', '2004-04-14 12:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(667693, 69317, 3765, '<td valign="top">I feel the contrast is a bit harsh. Composition fine though.</td>', 'I feel the contrast is a bit harsh. Composition fine though.', '2004-04-14 12:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(667694, 69768, 3765, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, good composition. Could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice tones, good composition. Could have been a bit sharper.', '2004-04-14 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(667696, 69839, 3765, '<td valign="top">Colours are outstanding. Composition fine.</td>', 'Colours are outstanding. Composition fine.', '2004-04-14 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(667700, 70087, 13136, '<td valign="top">The closeness, weird color and overexposure all hurt the shot.</td>', 'The closeness, weird color and overexposure all hurt the shot.', '2004-04-14 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(667701, 69907, 327, '<td valign="top">Hi, <br/>I like the idea of bonding with animals, but don''t really see lizards as loving, and loyal.  Beyond that (and not marking down)  the composition of the photo is weak.The man appears to be...?...sleeping and the lizard is just on his shoulder. I don''t see love happening here...or bonding. I think your shot is okay but you need to work on your composition to better get the idea across to the viewer. This is meant to be helpful I hope it is.</td>', 'Hi, I like the idea of bonding with animals, but don''t really see lizards as loving, and loyal.  Beyond that (and not marking down)  the composition of the photo is weak.The man appears to be...?...sleeping and the lizard is just on his shoulder. I don''t see love happening here...or bonding. I think your shot is okay but you need to work on your composition to better get the idea across to the viewer. This is meant to be helpful I hope it is.', '2004-04-14 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(667702, 69627, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Nice crop as well. The white balance/hue is a bit strange though, looks pink to me.</td>', 'Great idea! Nice crop as well. The white balance/hue is a bit strange though, looks pink to me.', '2004-04-14 12:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(667703, 68937, 8760, '<td valign="top">It''s out of focus, it has been seen so many times, droplets are too big, color is poor....i''m sorry but I can only give it a bad vote...</td>', 'It''s out of focus, it has been seen so many times, droplets are too big, color is poor....i''m sorry but I can only give it a bad vote...', '2004-04-14 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(667704, 70126, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, post processing is great!</td>', 'Nice lighting, post processing is great!', '2004-04-14 12:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(667707, 69982, 7543, '<td valign="top">Difficult lighting conditions, sky is overexposed and the ground is underexposed. If we could blend layers, exp. bracketing would do the trick. Maybe too much contrast done?</td>', 'Difficult lighting conditions, sky is overexposed and the ground is underexposed. If we could blend layers, exp. bracketing would do the trick. Maybe too much contrast done?', '2004-04-14 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(667709, 68825, 327, '<td valign="top">Hi.Cute title. I see the genie and I do see him as strong and powerful. I just wish that the angle was greater or that you''d been a bit closer making the hand apper larger. Looking at the left side he is a bit tilted forward. Not a bad entry, good luck.</td>', 'Hi.Cute title. I see the genie and I do see him as strong and powerful. I just wish that the angle was greater or that you''d been a bit closer making the hand apper larger. Looking at the left side he is a bit tilted forward. Not a bad entry, good luck.', '2004-04-14 12:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(667710, 70055, 3765, '<td valign="top">Lovely, subtle photo. Only the red border is too much of a distraction.</td>', 'Lovely, subtle photo. Only the red border is too much of a distraction.', '2004-04-14 12:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(667716, 70168, 13624, '<td valign="top">Do you mean strength of body odour? ;)</td>', 'Do you mean strength of body odour? ;)', '2004-04-14 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(667717, 69853, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture, bet you only had one go at this one!</td>', 'Nice motion capture, bet you only had one go at this one!', '2004-04-14 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(667718, 69954, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute carts, looks like fun. This is a good example for the challenge. I would suggested keeping watch for things like water drains right in the front of your shot. It''s a distraction and people do notice. The drain becomes a focal point for the viewers eye and takes away from the charm of the carts. Also the front legs of the pony are gone. This would of helped to complete the scene. I hope these comments are helpful they are not meant with a mean spirit.</td>', 'Cute carts, looks like fun. This is a good example for the challenge. I would suggested keeping watch for things like water drains right in the front of your shot. It''s a distraction and people do notice. The drain becomes a focal point for the viewers eye and takes away from the charm of the carts. Also the front legs of the pony are gone. This would of helped to complete the scene. I hope these comments are helpful they are not meant with a mean spirit.', '2004-04-14 12:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(667722, 70142, 7543, '<td valign="top">finger seems out of focus, backround a bit dull (I would have tried to take out the shadows on it). Crop seems a bit strange as well. Would keep more of the hand in frame.</td>', 'finger seems out of focus, backround a bit dull (I would have tried to take out the shadows on it). Crop seems a bit strange as well. Would keep more of the hand in frame.', '2004-04-14 12:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(667723, 69761, 327, '<td valign="top">lol. Impossibel to look at this and not smile. This is a new little baby. Very cute expression. Your lighting, focus and idea are all very good. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'lol. Impossibel to look at this and not smile. This is a new little baby. Very cute expression. Your lighting, focus and idea are all very good. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-14 12:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(667726, 69549, 7543, '<td valign="top">Background nice, good gradient. Nice B/W, the pipe could be a bit more lit though.</td>', 'Background nice, good gradient. Nice B/W, the pipe could be a bit more lit though.', '2004-04-14 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(667727, 70197, 20147, '<td valign="top">The egg is stronger the other way up!</td>', 'The egg is stronger the other way up!', '2004-04-14 12:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(667728, 69517, 16648, '<td valign="top">very very overexposed, too harsh to look at. border is a detraction also</td>', 'very very overexposed, too harsh to look at. border is a detraction also', '2004-04-14 12:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(667729, 69546, 16648, '<td valign="top">a bit underexposed</td>', 'a bit underexposed', '2004-04-14 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
