(667733, 69422, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the dof here --&lt;lack of&gt; <br/>To me this forces the viewer to focus on the subject. In this shot the colors in the background are very appealing. That isn''t always the case and can often cause them to look muddy. Great shooting. Love this affect, and the light is wonderfully controlled. Good luck in the challenge. 7 from me.</td>', 'I love the dof here --<lack of> To me this forces the viewer to focus on the subject. In this shot the colors in the background are very appealing. That isn''t always the case and can often cause them to look muddy. Great shooting. Love this affect, and the light is wonderfully controlled. Good luck in the challenge. 7 from me.', '2004-04-14 12:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(667734, 70063, 3102, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  I''m not even sure WHAT to say about this one... I definitely got a laugh out of it...!  I assume that your pants must need three legs...!</td>', 'Oh my!  I''m not even sure WHAT to say about this one... I definitely got a laugh out of it...!  I assume that your pants must need three legs...!', '2004-04-14 12:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(667738, 70120, 16648, '<td valign="top">most of the chain is nicely lit, but the part inteh foreground is too dark - perhaps a fill flash or a reflector would have helped</td>', 'most of the chain is nicely lit, but the part inteh foreground is too dark - perhaps a fill flash or a reflector would have helped', '2004-04-14 13:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(667739, 70157, 327, '<td valign="top">The composition here is outsanding. The motion blur or over sharpening is not as good. Maybe wind? Hand held? Sorry. I do like this shot and of course have been there many times. You did do well just some blur going on.</td>', 'The composition here is outsanding. The motion blur or over sharpening is not as good. Maybe wind? Hand held? Sorry. I do like this shot and of course have been there many times. You did do well just some blur going on.', '2004-04-14 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(667740, 68937, 17503, '<td valign="top">needs a more original technique and subject matter. The droplets should have been of different, and more random sizes and spacing.</td>', 'needs a more original technique and subject matter. The droplets should have been of different, and more random sizes and spacing.', '2004-04-14 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(667742, 69918, 16777, '<td valign="top">The street signs are an unfortunate distraction.</td>', 'The street signs are an unfortunate distraction.', '2004-04-14 13:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
