(667771, 70120, 20027, '<td valign="top">Is that a pole casting a shadow in the foreground. The shadow spoils it for me. Good idea.</td>', 'Is that a pole casting a shadow in the foreground. The shadow spoils it for me. Good idea.', '2004-04-14 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(667772, 70118, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love the placement on the whit cloth with the diagonal wrinkles.  Exposure is perfect with good clean whites and strong blacks.  Composition right on and even includes "serendipity" - the shadow that makes a cross.... (10)</td>', 'I love the placement on the whit cloth with the diagonal wrinkles.  Exposure is perfect with good clean whites and strong blacks.  Composition right on and even includes "serendipity" - the shadow that makes a cross.... (10)', '2004-04-14 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(667773, 70143, 10943, '<td valign="top">Whoa, hahah!  That is so funny!  Automatic 10!</td>', 'Whoa, hahah!  That is so funny!  Automatic 10!', '2004-04-14 13:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(667778, 69757, 327, '<td valign="top">//www.terryfoxrun.org/english/terry%20fox/default.asp?s=1 I hope that is the right Terry Fox. I had never heard of him, sounds like a great young man that didn''t get a fair break. <br/>I like your shot-focus, light, color, the composition is the weakness in my opinion. Too much tilt and along with the drop shadow frame it''s over done. I think less is more is a good lesson for a shot with two strong vertical subjects. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '//www.terryfoxrun.org/english/terry%20fox/default.asp?s=1 I hope that is the right Terry Fox. I had never heard of him, sounds like a great young man that didn''t get a fair break. I like your shot-focus, light, color, the composition is the weakness in my opinion. Too much tilt and along with the drop shadow frame it''s over done. I think less is more is a good lesson for a shot with two strong vertical subjects. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-14 13:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(667780, 68937, 7543, '<td valign="top">Not original at all, think the exact same idea has been done by jmsetzler (might even be a tutorial of it)</td>', 'Not original at all, think the exact same idea has been done by jmsetzler (might even be a tutorial of it)', '2004-04-14 13:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(667781, 69940, 16777, '<td valign="top">To dark.</td>', 'To dark.', '2004-04-14 13:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
