(667804, 70192, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice rim lighting.</td>', 'Very nice rim lighting.', '2004-04-14 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(667805, 69908, 15919, '<td valign="top">It´s comic and technically well done.  Dont know the main subject character or if he is suposed to represent something.  Think most of us have to look at it as some teddy-bear or a toy of some kind which may represent a much creativity but I find the image OK.</td>', 'It´s comic and technically well done.  Dont know the main subject character or if he is suposed to represent something.  Think most of us have to look at it as some teddy-bear or a toy of some kind which may represent a much creativity but I find the image OK.', '2004-04-14 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(667809, 69636, 16777, '<td valign="top">Needs better focus.</td>', 'Needs better focus.', '2004-04-14 13:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(667810, 69722, 15642, '<td valign="top">Where is strength or power?</td>', 'Where is strength or power?', '2004-04-14 13:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(667811, 69752, 327, '<td valign="top">The nature is strong and wants it back...? This title seems really abstract to me. Nature would reclaim a fiberglass boat?  Sorry that I don''t get. The shot is okay, good focus, light and color. I think you could looked for something with a better composition and not so abstract meaning of strong/strength.  True the rope is strong and yes, it''s holding the boat but without seeing the rest of the scene we are left to guess. Just my 2cents. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The nature is strong and wants it back...? This title seems really abstract to me. Nature would reclaim a fiberglass boat?  Sorry that I don''t get. The shot is okay, good focus, light and color. I think you could looked for something with a better composition and not so abstract meaning of strong/strength.  True the rope is strong and yes, it''s holding the boat but without seeing the rest of the scene we are left to guess. Just my 2cents. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-14 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(667814, 69103, 15642, '<td valign="top">The cage hurts the imagery, but nice shot</td>', 'The cage hurts the imagery, but nice shot', '2004-04-14 13:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(667816, 69189, 15919, '<td valign="top">Grainy and not very sharp.  You´ve probably been in pretty difficult lightning condition and when looking better the things I mentioned in the begining dont hurt the image a lot, rather gives it a certain atmosphere.  It´s a fine image though some could say it´s not technically good.  Maybe litle more contrast.</td>', 'Grainy and not very sharp.  You´ve probably been in pretty difficult lightning condition and when looking better the things I mentioned in the begining dont hurt the image a lot, rather gives it a certain atmosphere.  It´s a fine image though some could say it´s not technically good.  Maybe litle more contrast.', '2004-04-14 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(667817, 69849, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning color. I think a tight crop on jus the head of the Heron would worked well.<br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Stunning color. I think a tight crop on jus the head of the Heron would worked well.Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-14 13:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(667818, 70142, 15642, '<td valign="top">too fuzzy</td>', 'too fuzzy', '2004-04-14 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(667822, 69609, 15919, '<td valign="top">Maybe overcontrasted but then again it gives a original effect and the main subject seems perfectly exposed.  The expression of the boy´s face and body is very nice.</td>', 'Maybe overcontrasted but then again it gives a original effect and the main subject seems perfectly exposed.  The expression of the boy´s face and body is very nice.', '2004-04-14 13:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(667823, 69306, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. There seems to be little ''strength'' left in this old home...</td>', 'Nice shot. There seems to be little ''strength'' left in this old home...', '2004-04-14 13:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(667824, 70164, 327, '<td valign="top">Neighbors can be like that!! lol Great capture. The shot seems a little dark yes, could well be _my_ monitor. Beautiful birds. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Neighbors can be like that!! lol Great capture. The shot seems a little dark yes, could well be _my_ monitor. Beautiful birds. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-14 13:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(667825, 69915, 15642, '<td valign="top">The title is saying more than the shot...</td>', 'The title is saying more than the shot...', '2004-04-14 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(667826, 69724, 15642, '<td valign="top">a little flat for me...</td>', 'a little flat for me...', '2004-04-14 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(667827, 69537, 19608, '<td valign="top">I expected loads of shots like this, but there were just a handful.  This is by far the best of the bunch.  The silhouette is great.  Exposure right on.  Model''s hair is a great touch. Here''s a couple small recommendations: 1) Move the camera down just a bit so that the silhouette is all in the sky, showing the mountain/hill tops below his arms.  Move the model to the left a bit to remove the tree branches on the right side. (9)</td>', 'I expected loads of shots like this, but there were just a handful.  This is by far the best of the bunch.  The silhouette is great.  Exposure right on.  Model''s hair is a great touch. Here''s a couple small recommendations: 1) Move the camera down just a bit so that the silhouette is all in the sky, showing the mountain/hill tops below his arms.  Move the model to the left a bit to remove the tree branches on the right side. (9)', '2004-04-14 13:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(667828, 69295, 15919, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a litle more colorsaturation and maybe more contrast to give better expression of the background color, seems litle gray.  Would have liked stronger blue and pink.</td>', 'Would have liked a litle more colorsaturation and maybe more contrast to give better expression of the background color, seems litle gray.  Would have liked stronger blue and pink.', '2004-04-14 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(667829, 69473, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the title. Your colors seem a bit washed out and flat. Some contrast is needed. I think a bit off the top to pull the eye down even more. Also the right side one little rock could be cut out. Nice shot. I hope you do well, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Love the title. Your colors seem a bit washed out and flat. Some contrast is needed. I think a bit off the top to pull the eye down even more. Also the right side one little rock could be cut out. Nice shot. I hope you do well, meets the challenge.', '2004-04-14 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
