(667847, 70195, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and execution.  Although it works well on the white background, did you also try it on a solid black one (I think it would also be very effective)?  The text on the glass is a detractor for me. Also try some salt on the rim of the glass. (8)</td>', 'Very nice idea and execution.  Although it works well on the white background, did you also try it on a solid black one (I think it would also be very effective)?  The text on the glass is a detractor for me. Also try some salt on the rim of the glass. (8)', '2004-04-14 13:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
