(667866, 69747, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea and scene.  It would have been a 10 for me if the hands were showing more like the model were actually climbing.  As it is, the hands appear to me if there are just "resting"  there - not actually holding the model off the ground.  Still a very nice image though.)  (9)</td>', 'Great idea and scene.  It would have been a 10 for me if the hands were showing more like the model were actually climbing.  As it is, the hands appear to me if there are just "resting"  there - not actually holding the model off the ground.  Still a very nice image though.)  (9)', '2004-04-14 13:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(667867, 68937, 15207, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of Americana in this challenge. I guess people from other countries could say their country symbols are strong as well. This concept is a good idea for a photo, but it''s been done quite a bit in other challenges (the eye drops). My only suggestion would be that the drops in this particular image have very jagged edges. I''m not sure how you''d rectify that. It''s a good idea, but just not very original to me. - 5</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of Americana in this challenge. I guess people from other countries could say their country symbols are strong as well. This concept is a good idea for a photo, but it''s been done quite a bit in other challenges (the eye drops). My only suggestion would be that the drops in this particular image have very jagged edges. I''m not sure how you''d rectify that. It''s a good idea, but just not very original to me. - 5', '2004-04-14 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(667868, 70121, 15642, '<td valign="top">The title completely throws me.</td>', 'The title completely throws me.', '2004-04-14 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
