(667872, 69335, 10785, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s built by the German''s now!!<br/> <br/>But this shot is incredible. Great colors and DOF. Crytal clear and sharp! Awesome lighting as well!</td>', 'Too bad it''s built by the German''s now!! But this shot is incredible. Great colors and DOF. Crytal clear and sharp! Awesome lighting as well!', '2004-04-14 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(667873, 70131, 19116, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, expressive photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful, expressive photograph.', '2004-04-14 13:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(667874, 70171, 15207, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good image if you could really see the New Testament - maybe if it was red or something. The jeans are very well exposed and the lighting seems good for everything but the New Testament. I''m not a Christian but I do understand that some people get strength from a book so the concept is very good. - 5</td>', 'This would have been a good image if you could really see the New Testament - maybe if it was red or something. The jeans are very well exposed and the lighting seems good for everything but the New Testament. I''m not a Christian but I do understand that some people get strength from a book so the concept is very good. - 5', '2004-04-14 13:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
