(667896, 69915, 15207, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. I have the feeling you may have sharpened the image a bit too much. On my screen, the sharpness is a bit too much. I think you have great rich colours and contrast already and maybe didn''t need to sharpen it so much. However, this really stands out as an original and unique submission - 7</td>', 'I absolutely love this. I have the feeling you may have sharpened the image a bit too much. On my screen, the sharpness is a bit too much. I think you have great rich colours and contrast already and maybe didn''t need to sharpen it so much. However, this really stands out as an original and unique submission - 7', '2004-04-14 13:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(667897, 70171, 10785, '<td valign="top">Awesome Shot. Great message and great use of lighting and texture!<br/> <br/>You should sell this to the Gideons! (Or give it out of the goodness of your heart!)</td>', 'Awesome Shot. Great message and great use of lighting and texture! You should sell this to the Gideons! (Or give it out of the goodness of your heart!)', '2004-04-14 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
