(667904, 69516, 15207, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of extra pixels/noise in it. I''m wondering if you need to use ISO 100 or under if you''re taking shots. The lighting in this seems a bit off and the image doesn''t really stand out&gt; it''s taken from a unique and interesting angle, but the subjects just don''t pop. -5</td>', 'This image has a lot of extra pixels/noise in it. I''m wondering if you need to use ISO 100 or under if you''re taking shots. The lighting in this seems a bit off and the image doesn''t really stand out> it''s taken from a unique and interesting angle, but the subjects just don''t pop. -5', '2004-04-14 13:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
