(667932, 69981, 15207, '<td valign="top">For some reason we always get a lot of american symbols in these challenges. I like to vote on a) uniqueness and originality b) good composition c) excellent lighting that makes the image "pop" (I have trouble with this myself) d) good DOF (if appropriate) and e) a crisp, clear image free of tons of noise and compression artifacts.  I''m starting to feel the religious and american symbols are not as unique anymore. This one has good composition, but the lighting doesn''t really make it pop. I''m not sure what you could do differently with the lighting. It seems like there is a lot of noise and pixelation. I realize I''m only one voter and there are quite a few Americans involved in DP challenge so this image may speak to them more personally. The only other suggestion I have (for future challenges) is to try to use up the entire 640x480 pixel space for the image. You''ll find most winners have large images. - 5</td>', 'For some reason we always get a lot of american symbols in these challenges. I like to vote on a) uniqueness and originality b) good composition c) excellent lighting that makes the image "pop" (I have trouble with this myself) d) good DOF (if appropriate) and e) a crisp, clear image free of tons of noise and compression artifacts.  I''m starting to feel the religious and american symbols are not as unique anymore. This one has good composition, but the lighting doesn''t really make it pop. I''m not sure what you could do differently with the lighting. It seems like there is a lot of noise and pixelation. I realize I''m only one voter and there are quite a few Americans involved in DP challenge so this image may speak to them more personally. The only other suggestion I have (for future challenges) is to try to use up the entire 640x480 pixel space for the image. You''ll find most winners have large images. - 5', '2004-04-14 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(667933, 69838, 13136, '<td valign="top">The brightness and lack of contrast make it difficult to see what the equipment is doing.</td>', 'The brightness and lack of contrast make it difficult to see what the equipment is doing.', '2004-04-14 13:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(667935, 69732, 19116, '<td valign="top">Good content/composition.  Would have scored highre if the focus was sharper.</td>', 'Good content/composition.  Would have scored highre if the focus was sharper.', '2004-04-14 13:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(667936, 69295, 15207, '<td valign="top">For some reason we always get a lot of christian symbols in these challenges. I like to vote on a) uniqueness and originality b) good composition c) excellent lighting that makes the image "pop" (I have trouble with this myself) d) good DOF (if appropriate) and e) a crisp, clear image free of tons of noise and compression artifacts.  I''m starting to feel the religious and american symbols are not as unique anymore. This one has good composition, but the lighting doesn''t really make it pop. I''m not sure what you could do differently with the lighting. It seems like there is a lot of noise and pixelation. I realize I''m only one voter and there are quite a few Christians involved in DP challenge so this image may speak to them more personally.  . - 5</td>', 'For some reason we always get a lot of christian symbols in these challenges. I like to vote on a) uniqueness and originality b) good composition c) excellent lighting that makes the image "pop" (I have trouble with this myself) d) good DOF (if appropriate) and e) a crisp, clear image free of tons of noise and compression artifacts.  I''m starting to feel the religious and american symbols are not as unique anymore. This one has good composition, but the lighting doesn''t really make it pop. I''m not sure what you could do differently with the lighting. It seems like there is a lot of noise and pixelation. I realize I''m only one voter and there are quite a few Christians involved in DP challenge so this image may speak to them more personally.  . - 5', '2004-04-14 13:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
