(668048, 69317, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  I''d like the image a lot more if it were not such a high contrast depiction.</td>', 'I love the idea.  I''d like the image a lot more if it were not such a high contrast depiction.', '2004-04-14 14:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
