(668983, 69771, 16695, '<td valign="top">If anything, I think of "grace" and "beauty" when I see these falls.  If it was Niagra or something of that scale, then I''d imagine "strength."  Still a pleasant photo, but not quite on target to me.</td>', 'If anything, I think of "grace" and "beauty" when I see these falls.  If it was Niagra or something of that scale, then I''d imagine "strength."  Still a pleasant photo, but not quite on target to me.', '2004-04-14 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
