(669078, 69371, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like this one!  The strength of the waves, and the is it accidental that those people are in there?  Because my first reaction is that those are swimmers/divers/surfers, and there "strength" adds to it.  The action of the waves is the best part, I think.  The foaming of the water is a nice contrast against the blackness of the shore, and the black and white work well with this photo.  Great job!</td>', 'I like this one!  The strength of the waves, and the is it accidental that those people are in there?  Because my first reaction is that those are swimmers/divers/surfers, and there "strength" adds to it.  The action of the waves is the best part, I think.  The foaming of the water is a nice contrast against the blackness of the shore, and the black and white work well with this photo.  Great job!', '2004-04-14 23:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(669079, 69614, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is not a pleasing image nor is it well composed.  Although, I don''t really know how you would compose this subject to be ''good''.  Not to mention, this is a very loose interpretation of ''strength'' and I would argue that it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'This is not a pleasing image nor is it well composed.  Although, I don''t really know how you would compose this subject to be ''good''.  Not to mention, this is a very loose interpretation of ''strength'' and I would argue that it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-04-14 23:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
