(669104, 69993, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, without the strength of our tripods, where would we be?  Mabe needs a little more drama in the photo, for such an everyday object.  Maybe a change in lighting.</td>', 'Interesting idea, without the strength of our tripods, where would we be?  Mabe needs a little more drama in the photo, for such an everyday object.  Maybe a change in lighting.', '2004-04-14 23:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(669106, 69600, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose, the look on her face.  I think the choice of b/w was a good decision.  The lighting on her body works well also.  I don''t like the bright spot on the wall behind her and I wish the image were bigger.</td>', 'I really like the pose, the look on her face.  I think the choice of b/w was a good decision.  The lighting on her body works well also.  I don''t like the bright spot on the wall behind her and I wish the image were bigger.', '2004-04-14 23:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(669107, 69991, 19519, '<td valign="top">Master Locks are the best, aren''t they!  I like your representation, a lock and chain.  The black and white works well with the subject, and I like the fact that you used a rusty, old lock, instead of a new one.  The composition and lighting work well, too.  Overall, great photo!</td>', 'Master Locks are the best, aren''t they!  I like your representation, a lock and chain.  The black and white works well with the subject, and I like the fact that you used a rusty, old lock, instead of a new one.  The composition and lighting work well, too.  Overall, great photo!', '2004-04-14 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(669109, 69116, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like your subject, there is much strength in the tiniest bee.  I like the action in the wings, and the bee and flower are in crisp focus.  Overall, nice job!</td>', 'I like your subject, there is much strength in the tiniest bee.  I like the action in the wings, and the bee and flower are in crisp focus.  Overall, nice job!', '2004-04-14 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
