(669131, 69362, 13035, '<td valign="top">very creative, and a well executed studio shot.  A really hope that your can is something that you bought in a novelty store, and not something that you digitally created.  There will be another week of debates in the member forums.  Good luck to you.  8</td>', 'very creative, and a well executed studio shot.  A really hope that your can is something that you bought in a novelty store, and not something that you digitally created.  There will be another week of debates in the member forums.  Good luck to you.  8', '2004-04-15 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
