(669148, 69092, 13035, '<td valign="top">An extremely nice capture and placed well agaist what I assume is a created background.  If that is the case you did a great job of selecting to isolate your subject, and a great job of color selection.  I am distracted by the gray stripe to the left of the bud.  My is pulling left.  But, your framing is tall and skinny to begin with, so for tighter cropping you would have had to take some off the bottom as well, and lost some of your yellows in the bud.  But, thant-s what I would have done.  Great post.  8</td>', 'An extremely nice capture and placed well agaist what I assume is a created background.  If that is the case you did a great job of selecting to isolate your subject, and a great job of color selection.  I am distracted by the gray stripe to the left of the bud.  My is pulling left.  But, your framing is tall and skinny to begin with, so for tighter cropping you would have had to take some off the bottom as well, and lost some of your yellows in the bud.  But, thant-s what I would have done.  Great post.  8', '2004-04-15 00:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
