(669347, 70190, 9809, '<td valign="top">Was the green/yellow hue a choice or an accident? To me it makes them look sickly......................... looking at the back of their heads, blurry refs legs in the background and nothing else but floor bores me a bit too. Sorry. OTOH, I do see the "strength" being shown.</td>', 'Was the green/yellow hue a choice or an accident? To me it makes them look sickly......................... looking at the back of their heads, blurry refs legs in the background and nothing else but floor bores me a bit too. Sorry. OTOH, I do see the "strength" being shown.', '2004-04-15 03:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
