(669787, 69023, 20027, '<td valign="top">I can''t make the connection to strength. 2 of the main subjects are cropped off on their edges. The entire image appears to be slightly out of focus. Distractions in the upper left and lower right hand corners.</td>', 'I can''t make the connection to strength. 2 of the main subjects are cropped off on their edges. The entire image appears to be slightly out of focus. Distractions in the upper left and lower right hand corners.', '2004-04-15 11:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
