(669931, 69883, 7969, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, it is hillarious. I would love to be at a show where they are doing this!  You captured it well too. The motion blur is well done.</td>', 'I love this shot, it is hillarious. I would love to be at a show where they are doing this!  You captured it well too. The motion blur is well done.', '2004-04-15 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(669940, 69303, 15919, '<td valign="top">Great capture but seems maybe a litle underlit.  The shutter speed is fine since you get the player pretty sharp but get the motion of his hand and the ball, that´s very good.  If you are able to get the player in good focus you can absolutely open up the apperture since it dont matter if the craud in the background gets out of focus.  In fect I think it would give a better effect.<br/>Al the same, this is a good sport picture.</td>', 'Great capture but seems maybe a litle underlit.  The shutter speed is fine since you get the player pretty sharp but get the motion of his hand and the ball, that´s very good.  If you are able to get the player in good focus you can absolutely open up the apperture since it dont matter if the craud in the background gets out of focus.  In fect I think it would give a better effect.Al the same, this is a good sport picture.', '2004-04-15 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(669945, 69162, 15919, '<td valign="top">Ooouuch, this dosent look good.  You get a very good effect of the "thing" beating at the back, hard for me to but it into words.  Dont know if its a good representation of strength or power, maybe will power.</td>', 'Ooouuch, this dosent look good.  You get a very good effect of the "thing" beating at the back, hard for me to but it into words.  Dont know if its a good representation of strength or power, maybe will power.', '2004-04-15 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(669949, 70131, 15919, '<td valign="top">Strong image with message.  The darkness and the grainy "texture" of the image suits well the feelings I think you are trying to express, though you might say that the burden is overthrowing the strength of the model.<br/>Fine work of art.</td>', 'Strong image with message.  The darkness and the grainy "texture" of the image suits well the feelings I think you are trying to express, though you might say that the burden is overthrowing the strength of the model.Fine work of art.', '2004-04-15 12:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(669951, 70195, 16790, '<td valign="top">Love this shot - so crisp and colourful!</td>', 'Love this shot - so crisp and colourful!', '2004-04-15 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
