(670458, 69559, 18194, '<td valign="top">I agree with your sentiments on this completely.   However I dont think this is as good a photo as it could be.  Given that this is a photo challenge I cant rate very high.  Dont take your rating on this to be a reflection on how people feel about this subject, rather look at your photo from the stand point of its quality as a photo.</td>', 'I agree with your sentiments on this completely.   However I dont think this is as good a photo as it could be.  Given that this is a photo challenge I cant rate very high.  Dont take your rating on this to be a reflection on how people feel about this subject, rather look at your photo from the stand point of its quality as a photo.', '2004-04-15 16:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(670462, 69748, 19780, '<td valign="top">Really captures the physics of the moment and power of the subjects as they pull on the rope. The sepia also helps to lend a timeless quality to the struggle</td>', 'Really captures the physics of the moment and power of the subjects as they pull on the rope. The sepia also helps to lend a timeless quality to the struggle', '2004-04-15 16:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(670463, 69768, 19780, '<td valign="top">I loved this and hoped that we would see more photos depicting nature overcoming obstacles like this. I like the sepia quality. I wish it were slightly sharper.</td>', 'I loved this and hoped that we would see more photos depicting nature overcoming obstacles like this. I like the sepia quality. I wish it were slightly sharper.', '2004-04-15 16:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(670466, 69724, 18194, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the lighting is a bit off. The glare from the one book pulls the focus off the center.</td>', 'Nice idea but the lighting is a bit off. The glare from the one book pulls the focus off the center.', '2004-04-15 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(670477, 69116, 3102, '<td valign="top">A solid 9 from me!  I love how you caught the motion of the wings here.  The only thing keeping it from being ("bee"-ing) a 10 is that I don''t feel it does a great job of meeting the challenge topic... it doesn''t quite scream "strength" to me.</td>', 'A solid 9 from me!  I love how you caught the motion of the wings here.  The only thing keeping it from being ("bee"-ing) a 10 is that I don''t feel it does a great job of meeting the challenge topic... it doesn''t quite scream "strength" to me.', '2004-04-15 16:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(670480, 69761, 10339, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  I love the black background and the colors.</td>', 'Great expression!  I love the black background and the colors.', '2004-04-15 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(670490, 69937, 14055, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfull picture! <br/>I can imagine to see this man wrestling with an orka-whale :)<br/>What did you do to get the background look like this.</td>', 'What a wonderfull picture! I can imagine to see this man wrestling with an orka-whale :)What did you do to get the background look like this.', '2004-04-15 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(670493, 69480, 5728, '<td valign="top">I recognise the glasses from your Insomnia shot! I recognise the bra from your 36B shot! I recognise the little spot on the right of your face from your self portrait pic! I recognise the earrings from your self portrait shot, oh and the rings on your fingers are also in your Insomnia shot! And I recognise your B&amp;W style! Good huh??????? Am I good????? Now I''m giving you and me a 10 for all that recognising :)))))</td>', 'I recognise the glasses from your Insomnia shot! I recognise the bra from your 36B shot! I recognise the little spot on the right of your face from your self portrait pic! I recognise the earrings from your self portrait shot, oh and the rings on your fingers are also in your Insomnia shot! And I recognise your B&W style! Good huh??????? Am I good????? Now I''m giving you and me a 10 for all that recognising :)))))', '2004-04-15 16:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(670501, 69883, 14055, '<td valign="top">Very nice and dynamic picture.</td>', 'Very nice and dynamic picture.', '2004-04-15 16:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(670503, 68877, 12151, '<td valign="top">Those cirrus clouds add a lot to the image, together with the white of that steeple.  Very clean and serene.</td>', 'Those cirrus clouds add a lot to the image, together with the white of that steeple.  Very clean and serene.', '2004-04-15 16:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(670506, 70063, 14055, '<td valign="top">yep nice biceps.</td>', 'yep nice biceps.', '2004-04-15 16:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(670507, 69754, 12151, '<td valign="top">Interesting view - I guess this is how you''re supposed to view the statue.  I like the contrast and how you captured the textures, both of which add to the feeling of "strength."</td>', 'Interesting view - I guess this is how you''re supposed to view the statue.  I like the contrast and how you captured the textures, both of which add to the feeling of "strength."', '2004-04-15 16:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(670510, 69853, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot.   I might say I wish it were clearer, but the blur is to your advantage in many ways, adding to the action.  Some people will be put off by the blur and rough quality to this image.  I''m not one of them.  Top score for the week for the best shot showcasing strength, and tied with one other photo.</td>', 'This is an incredible shot.   I might say I wish it were clearer, but the blur is to your advantage in many ways, adding to the action.  Some people will be put off by the blur and rough quality to this image.  I''m not one of them.  Top score for the week for the best shot showcasing strength, and tied with one other photo.', '2004-04-15 16:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(670512, 69932, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot!  I wish the lighting had been better (with the sun behind you instead of in front) when you shot it, though...!</td>', 'I like the concept a lot!  I wish the lighting had been better (with the sun behind you instead of in front) when you shot it, though...!', '2004-04-15 16:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(670513, 70190, 3102, '<td valign="top">I might have tinkered with the colors a little to get rid of some of the yellow cast to this one.  It might have also been a little better to see their facial expressions.</td>', 'I might have tinkered with the colors a little to get rid of some of the yellow cast to this one.  It might have also been a little better to see their facial expressions.', '2004-04-15 16:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(670515, 69783, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome (8)</td>', 'Awesome (8)', '2004-04-15 16:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(670516, 69231, 12151, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say about this portrait.  It''s definitely great, technically.  The face is haunting, and I don''t know what to make of the cross in the same image a that face.  The image has a complex feel, even if the look is pretty simple but gloomy.  This will score high.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say about this portrait.  It''s definitely great, technically.  The face is haunting, and I don''t know what to make of the cross in the same image a that face.  The image has a complex feel, even if the look is pretty simple but gloomy.  This will score high.', '2004-04-15 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(670517, 69722, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, if only it weren''t so centered and those plants are in the way. I would have cropped this a little more. The lighting and the color tones are awesome!</td>', 'I like this photo, if only it weren''t so centered and those plants are in the way. I would have cropped this a little more. The lighting and the color tones are awesome!', '2004-04-15 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(670519, 70192, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and placement of subject.  No distracting "problems" in this photo for me.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and placement of subject.  No distracting "problems" in this photo for me.', '2004-04-15 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(670520, 70142, 5728, '<td valign="top">Focus!!!!</td>', 'Focus!!!!', '2004-04-15 16:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(670521, 69953, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice, I like this! (8)</td>', 'Choice, I like this! (8)', '2004-04-15 16:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(670522, 69593, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clean, focused and detailed!</td>', 'Clean, focused and detailed!', '2004-04-15 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(670523, 70123, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a very good image - your composition and crop  is excellent.  The one hting that throws me off a bit is the plainness of that guy in the corner, which slightly detracts from the feeling of "strength."</td>', 'This is a very good image - your composition and crop  is excellent.  The one hting that throws me off a bit is the plainness of that guy in the corner, which slightly detracts from the feeling of "strength."', '2004-04-15 16:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(670524, 69422, 12151, '<td valign="top">Great use of blur, and excellent coloring.  Simple, but effective.</td>', 'Great use of blur, and excellent coloring.  Simple, but effective.', '2004-04-15 16:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(670525, 70123, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is power! Wow, except for the black splotch on the left, fantastic!</td>', 'This is power! Wow, except for the black splotch on the left, fantastic!', '2004-04-15 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(670526, 70083, 12151, '<td valign="top">This photo is slightly foreboding, which adds to the feeling of strength.  Nice composition.</td>', 'This photo is slightly foreboding, which adds to the feeling of strength.  Nice composition.', '2004-04-15 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(670529, 70166, 6132, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I''m sure you''ll get many comments of it being overexposed but I myself do actually like this image. It''s seems to be quite rare to stumble upon high key images within challenges. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting image, I''m sure you''ll get many comments of it being overexposed but I myself do actually like this image. It''s seems to be quite rare to stumble upon high key images within challenges. Good luck.', '2004-04-15 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(670530, 70164, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image!</td>', 'This is a beautiful image!', '2004-04-15 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(670531, 69982, 12151, '<td valign="top">The colors and contrast here make the image look almost surreal, like a storybook page or an album cover.  It has an interesting style that displays a different kind of "crazier" strength.</td>', 'The colors and contrast here make the image look almost surreal, like a storybook page or an album cover.  It has an interesting style that displays a different kind of "crazier" strength.', '2004-04-15 17:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(670532, 70187, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea! I didn''t know magnets were that strong!</td>', 'Good idea! I didn''t know magnets were that strong!', '2004-04-15 17:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(670533, 70118, 889, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like how you used a third set to create the vertical shadow that ties it all together.</td>', 'Nice, I like how you used a third set to create the vertical shadow that ties it all together.', '2004-04-15 17:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(670536, 69371, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good!!!! The strength of water cannot be beaten!</td>', 'Good!!!! The strength of water cannot be beaten!', '2004-04-15 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(670537, 69945, 18194, '<td valign="top">Sorry this just does not do anything for me, maybe others will find it to their tastes.</td>', 'Sorry this just does not do anything for me, maybe others will find it to their tastes.', '2004-04-15 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(670540, 69061, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image! I am missing a little contrast though, but still a 9 from me. I love this kind of photography!</td>', 'Wonderful image! I am missing a little contrast though, but still a 9 from me. I love this kind of photography!', '2004-04-15 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(670541, 70160, 18194, '<td valign="top">I am not at all sure what the meaning is here.  In any event the focus is way off and much seems to be hidden in the shadows.</td>', 'I am not at all sure what the meaning is here.  In any event the focus is way off and much seems to be hidden in the shadows.', '2004-04-15 17:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(670544, 69907, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  This image honestly isn''t the boldest or most inspiring image here to me, and it doesn''t make me think "strength" as much as others.  However the composition and coloring has a unique look and feel that definitely is not "weak."  It''s got a different of "strength"; well done.</td>', 'This is interesting.  This image honestly isn''t the boldest or most inspiring image here to me, and it doesn''t make me think "strength" as much as others.  However the composition and coloring has a unique look and feel that definitely is not "weak."  It''s got a different of "strength"; well done.', '2004-04-15 17:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(670548, 69371, 12151, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  The contrast adds power, although it seems slightly grainy because of it.  Either way, it''s a great shot, and the two people also add a lot.</td>', 'Great detail.  The contrast adds power, although it seems slightly grainy because of it.  Either way, it''s a great shot, and the two people also add a lot.', '2004-04-15 17:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(670549, 70151, 10124, '<td valign="top">i like it</td>', 'i like it', '2004-04-15 17:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(670550, 69954, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, but I find it just a little too tightly cropped!</td>', 'This is good, but I find it just a little too tightly cropped!', '2004-04-15 17:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(670551, 69758, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid there''s just not a whole lot of creativity behind this one... and the water drops on the lens don''t help...</td>', 'I''m afraid there''s just not a whole lot of creativity behind this one... and the water drops on the lens don''t help...', '2004-04-15 17:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(670552, 69838, 18194, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems really harsh to me.</td>', 'The lighting seems really harsh to me.', '2004-04-15 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(670554, 69937, 12151, '<td valign="top">Nice unique and interesting style to this photo, and the capture of the guy is technically sound.</td>', 'Nice unique and interesting style to this photo, and the capture of the guy is technically sound.', '2004-04-15 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(670555, 70066, 10124, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2004-04-15 17:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(670556, 69422, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing creative use of shallow depth of field! The background comes over like a water color painting!</td>', 'Amazing creative use of shallow depth of field! The background comes over like a water color painting!', '2004-04-15 17:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(670559, 69956, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective! Good work!</td>', 'Awesome perspective! Good work!', '2004-04-15 17:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(670561, 70177, 18194, '<td valign="top">The small size of this photo hurts it.</td>', 'The small size of this photo hurts it.', '2004-04-15 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(670562, 69882, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail! Good idea!</td>', 'Amazing detail! Good idea!', '2004-04-15 17:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(670563, 70154, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  It seems in between a candid photo and a surreal piece of art, because of the expression (especially the eyes), composition (gray in back but bright in front), and the overall color contrast.  Interesting look.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  It seems in between a candid photo and a surreal piece of art, because of the expression (especially the eyes), composition (gray in back but bright in front), and the overall color contrast.  Interesting look.', '2004-04-15 17:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(670566, 70063, 6132, '<td valign="top">*lol* Probably the most humorous image of this challenge :o) I''m sure the censorship police will be pleased with this one ;o) Interesting composition and good use of lighting...amongst other things.</td>', '*lol* Probably the most humorous image of this challenge :o) I''m sure the censorship police will be pleased with this one ;o) Interesting composition and good use of lighting...amongst other things.', '2004-04-15 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(670569, 69748, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent depiction of the challenge! Toning = WOW! (10)</td>', 'Excellent depiction of the challenge! Toning = WOW! (10)', '2004-04-15 17:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(670571, 69306, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting photo - and you''ve captured just the right kind of sky to go along with the house.  The color balance is great.  I like how the image makes you wonder if the house is in a state of "weakness" instead of a state of "strength," and how you can''t really tell.  This gets my top vote for the week, along with one other photo.</td>', 'This is a really interesting photo - and you''ve captured just the right kind of sky to go along with the house.  The color balance is great.  I like how the image makes you wonder if the house is in a state of "weakness" instead of a state of "strength," and how you can''t really tell.  This gets my top vote for the week, along with one other photo.', '2004-04-15 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(670572, 69300, 5728, '<td valign="top">Go Carlos :)</td>', 'Go Carlos :)', '2004-04-15 17:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(670574, 69883, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- I can''t say I''d let my kid ride a sheep!  Looks like a fast, painful, wooly death waiting to happen!  Excellent shot, though!  Great job of catching the motion!</td>', 'Wow -- I can''t say I''d let my kid ride a sheep!  Looks like a fast, painful, wooly death waiting to happen!  Excellent shot, though!  Great job of catching the motion!', '2004-04-15 17:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(670575, 69991, 5728, '<td valign="top">Luv it! Nothing to complain about here, top shot! (10)</td>', 'Luv it! Nothing to complain about here, top shot! (10)', '2004-04-15 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(670576, 69725, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a really great image.  The one thing I don''t like is all the negative space to the right and left.  That''s the only thing making it not score in the very top for me.</td>', 'This is a really great image.  The one thing I don''t like is all the negative space to the right and left.  That''s the only thing making it not score in the very top for me.', '2004-04-15 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(670577, 69831, 16777, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, seems like there are to many lost highlights thouugh.</td>', 'Interesting idea, seems like there are to many lost highlights thouugh.', '2004-04-15 17:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(670578, 70121, 5728, '<td valign="top">TYPO!!!!! But I won''t hold that against you :) This image is wonderful, the composition even better!! (10)</td>', 'TYPO!!!!! But I won''t hold that against you :) This image is wonderful, the composition even better!! (10)', '2004-04-15 17:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(670580, 69738, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea! Her expression is priceless!</td>', 'Good idea! Her expression is priceless!', '2004-04-15 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(670583, 69303, 5728, '<td valign="top">Shot!!! Well captured (10)</td>', 'Shot!!! Well captured (10)', '2004-04-15 17:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(670584, 69952, 5728, '<td valign="top">Strength is more than hope!</td>', 'Strength is more than hope!', '2004-04-15 17:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(670585, 68996, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is good! Fantastique! (10)</td>', 'Now this is good! Fantastique! (10)', '2004-04-15 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
