(670589, 70156, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good toning, good shot. I just would either have cropped the head right out of the frame or added more of it. As it is it is kind of distracting somewhat.</td>', 'Good idea, good toning, good shot. I just would either have cropped the head right out of the frame or added more of it. As it is it is kind of distracting somewhat.', '2004-04-15 17:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(670590, 70160, 3102, '<td valign="top">Um... it honestly doesn''t strike me as being "photographically strong" at all, I''m afraid.  It''s out of focus, and has no clear subject matter... and I can''t quite figure out how it relates to the challenge.  Sorry...</td>', 'Um... it honestly doesn''t strike me as being "photographically strong" at all, I''m afraid.  It''s out of focus, and has no clear subject matter... and I can''t quite figure out how it relates to the challenge.  Sorry...', '2004-04-15 17:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
