(670749, 69811, 19608, '<td valign="top">Pretty busy photo.  The green diagonal area is a nice touch.  Flat lighting didn''t help much, might have been better with afternoon long shadows.</td>', 'Pretty busy photo.  The green diagonal area is a nice touch.  Flat lighting didn''t help much, might have been better with afternoon long shadows.', '2004-04-15 18:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(670750, 70162, 14986, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea for the challenge.  I think I might like it better with less concrete pillars on both sides.</td>', 'Not a bad idea for the challenge.  I think I might like it better with less concrete pillars on both sides.', '2004-04-15 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(670751, 70194, 15242, '<td valign="top">Try it in B&amp;W.  THe colors (orangr, green purple, yellow) distract from a real nice image.</td>', 'Try it in B&W.  THe colors (orangr, green purple, yellow) distract from a real nice image.', '2004-04-15 18:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(670752, 70190, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definite show of strength - and you don''t need either face to show it.  The yellowish cast detracts a bit as does the ref''s legs at the top.</td>', 'Definite show of strength - and you don''t need either face to show it.  The yellowish cast detracts a bit as does the ref''s legs at the top.', '2004-04-15 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(670753, 69194, 19948, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept, but the photo quality is quite soft throughout</td>', 'I really like the concept, but the photo quality is quite soft throughout', '2004-04-15 18:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(670755, 69853, 14986, '<td valign="top">Hope you had the camera covered!  Cool shot.  I think it would have been better if you could have nailed the focus more and not blown out the whites near the center.  However, this had to be a hard shot to get and I think you did well, and certainly many times better than I probably could!  I wonder how many times they had to do this.</td>', 'Hope you had the camera covered!  Cool shot.  I think it would have been better if you could have nailed the focus more and not blown out the whites near the center.  However, this had to be a hard shot to get and I think you did well, and certainly many times better than I probably could!  I wonder how many times they had to do this.', '2004-04-15 18:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(670756, 69944, 15242, '<td valign="top">Wayyyyyyy over exposed, not real interesting.</td>', 'Wayyyyyyy over exposed, not real interesting.', '2004-04-15 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(670757, 69834, 15574, '<td valign="top">8 for being original...but the quality and overall appeal..ummm not so high</td>', '8 for being original...but the quality and overall appeal..ummm not so high', '2004-04-15 18:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
