(670760, 69778, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s burning but I really ilke the composition of this shot...especially the people at the top and the reflection of the flames in the water.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s burning but I really ilke the composition of this shot...especially the people at the top and the reflection of the flames in the water.', '2004-04-15 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
