(670763, 69194, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice studio setup - like the use of all black and white in a color photo.  I think the lighting seup could have been better executed as the top of the glass seems a bit weak.  Both the left and right side of the top of the glass tend to merge into the background.</td>', 'Nice studio setup - like the use of all black and white in a color photo.  I think the lighting seup could have been better executed as the top of the glass seems a bit weak.  Both the left and right side of the top of the glass tend to merge into the background.', '2004-04-15 18:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
