(671074, 69647, 14476, '<td valign="top">As I sneeze my way through another month, I can relate to this image and the title.  It''s strong, okay!  I even like the power lines in the distance.  It''s the something extra needed to break up the yellow patterns.  Good one.</td>', 'As I sneeze my way through another month, I can relate to this image and the title.  It''s strong, okay!  I even like the power lines in the distance.  It''s the something extra needed to break up the yellow patterns.  Good one.', '2004-04-15 22:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
