(671108, 69113, 7560, '<td valign="top">You are on the right track. This has the potential to be a very powerful shot. It would be stronger compositionally if you to the right about 2 feet and had a clear shot of the wrestler doing the tossings'' face. I''d also suggest using a shorter DOF to blur the people in the background and make them less distracting.  Fits the challenge, but too visually cluttered. 4</td>', 'You are on the right track. This has the potential to be a very powerful shot. It would be stronger compositionally if you to the right about 2 feet and had a clear shot of the wrestler doing the tossings'' face. I''d also suggest using a shorter DOF to blur the people in the background and make them less distracting.  Fits the challenge, but too visually cluttered. 4', '2004-04-15 23:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
