(671133, 69517, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Overexposed on the middle part of the flag and the pole. I think you spent more time on your border than on the photo itself.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Overexposed on the middle part of the flag and the pole. I think you spent more time on your border than on the photo itself.', '2004-04-15 23:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
