(671175, 69363, 9668, '<td valign="top">Huge WOW factor. Great clarity. With composition I would like to see more of the space the man is traveling into (is he flying off the whale!?) and less of the bottom of the water. I know you can''t change this but the background is a bit distracting (puts in in perspective although). Overall - great shot. Can''t wait to see how this does (I expect it in the top 10)</td>', 'Huge WOW factor. Great clarity. With composition I would like to see more of the space the man is traveling into (is he flying off the whale!?) and less of the bottom of the water. I know you can''t change this but the background is a bit distracting (puts in in perspective although). Overall - great shot. Can''t wait to see how this does (I expect it in the top 10)', '2004-04-15 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(671178, 70087, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the full frame/out of frame idea, but I think the composition could have been better. It does a great job to show the muscles in this horses face, I just think it could have been set up a little better.</td>', 'I like the full frame/out of frame idea, but I think the composition could have been better. It does a great job to show the muscles in this horses face, I just think it could have been set up a little better.', '2004-04-16 00:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
