(671260, 69336, 8953, '<td valign="top">So...I bet you are getting nailed because you let the horn run out of the image? I shot this from directly underneath...I actually was prone on the sidewalk:) I can see where some folks just would not get it, depending on thier faith. A night time shot of this does demand a steady hand or a tripod as well. I have to vote to get my comment to stick.</td>', 'So...I bet you are getting nailed because you let the horn run out of the image? I shot this from directly underneath...I actually was prone on the sidewalk:) I can see where some folks just would not get it, depending on thier faith. A night time shot of this does demand a steady hand or a tripod as well. I have to vote to get my comment to stick.', '2004-04-16 01:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
