(671287, 69524, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like this interpretation of the Challenge.  Sort of "Power to the People."  And you caught it at an interesting time of day too, with nice lighting.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this interpretation of the Challenge.  Sort of "Power to the People."  And you caught it at an interesting time of day too, with nice lighting.  Good luck!', '2004-04-16 01:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(671288, 69559, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is certainly a valid interpretation of the challenge.  The resolution on the faces of the protesters is well shown by your photography.  Excellent depth of field on this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yes, this is certainly a valid interpretation of the challenge.  The resolution on the faces of the protesters is well shown by your photography.  Excellent depth of field on this.  Good luck.', '2004-04-16 01:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(671289, 69907, 14476, '<td valign="top">Glad there are females around who aren''t squeamish at the smaller versions of wildlife.  You caught a nice situation here.  Good luck.</td>', 'Glad there are females around who aren''t squeamish at the smaller versions of wildlife.  You caught a nice situation here.  Good luck.', '2004-04-16 01:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(671291, 70164, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, boy!  Who''s going to win.  The beautiful rendition of the wingspan alone is well within the Challenge guidelines.  Good work!</td>', 'Oh, boy!  Who''s going to win.  The beautiful rendition of the wingspan alone is well within the Challenge guidelines.  Good work!', '2004-04-16 01:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(671294, 70191, 14476, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but that spinach looks awfully unappetizing.  Nevertheless, this is a humerous and delightful take on the Challenge, and nicely photographed too.  Good luck.  I''m sure Olive Oyl says so too.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but that spinach looks awfully unappetizing.  Nevertheless, this is a humerous and delightful take on the Challenge, and nicely photographed too.  Good luck.  I''m sure Olive Oyl says so too.', '2004-04-16 01:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(671295, 69937, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, he looks like a tough one!  Nicely photographed and that blurry background is perfect for this excellent portrait.</td>', 'Oh, he looks like a tough one!  Nicely photographed and that blurry background is perfect for this excellent portrait.', '2004-04-16 01:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(671296, 70042, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed.  HOpe you do well with this charming image.</td>', 'Beautifully photographed.  HOpe you do well with this charming image.', '2004-04-16 01:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(671297, 69831, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like this whimsical image.  Could almost be called "Dancing with Pliers".  I''m not sure where the Strength Challenge comes in, but I don''t really care.  It''s a delightful picture and I"m glad you entered it.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this whimsical image.  Could almost be called "Dancing with Pliers".  I''m not sure where the Strength Challenge comes in, but I don''t really care.  It''s a delightful picture and I"m glad you entered it.  Good luck.', '2004-04-16 02:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(671298, 69770, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, the name of the boat says it all.  Good seeing, and good photography.  I can only add:  "Good Luck"  cause it''s a very nice picture.</td>', 'Well, the name of the boat says it all.  Good seeing, and good photography.  I can only add:  "Good Luck"  cause it''s a very nice picture.', '2004-04-16 02:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(671299, 69759, 14476, '<td valign="top">You were so right to enter this seedling into the Challenge.  You have photographed it well also.  Good Luck.</td>', 'You were so right to enter this seedling into the Challenge.  You have photographed it well also.  Good Luck.', '2004-04-16 02:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(671301, 69918, 14476, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you entered this magnificant shot in black and white, because I have a feeling the sky was not your friend when you took the image.  You have captured the power of this structure well.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m glad you entered this magnificant shot in black and white, because I have a feeling the sky was not your friend when you took the image.  You have captured the power of this structure well.  Good luck.', '2004-04-16 02:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
