(671396, 69889, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot...  It''s hard to decide if that''s a rock, or a big tree (I''m using a crap monitor just now...)  Looks deceiving, but nicely...  The blue tones of the sky and water are great, really like the sharp line of the horizon. Well done!</td>', 'I really like this shot...  It''s hard to decide if that''s a rock, or a big tree (I''m using a crap monitor just now...)  Looks deceiving, but nicely...  The blue tones of the sky and water are great, really like the sharp line of the horizon. Well done!', '2004-04-16 04:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
