(671407, 70043, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, like your idea for the challenge.  Seems a little overexposed maybe round her dress?  Now, this is a little nitpick, may seem weird, but it looks like he''s squeezing her chin?  Doesn''t make me want to score it down though...</td>', 'This is a great shot, like your idea for the challenge.  Seems a little overexposed maybe round her dress?  Now, this is a little nitpick, may seem weird, but it looks like he''s squeezing her chin?  Doesn''t make me want to score it down though...', '2004-04-16 04:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(671408, 70152, 14255, '<td valign="top">Nice Textures</td>', 'Nice Textures', '2004-04-16 04:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(671410, 69913, 14255, '<td valign="top">A different angle so that the back of the metal roadsign wasn''t in the picture would have improved it as the road signn takes your attention away from the bull a bit. Would have also shot slightly lower as back feet are slightly cut off, there is more space at top of image so it would have been possible to do this.<br/>Nice shot though. (6)</td>', 'A different angle so that the back of the metal roadsign wasn''t in the picture would have improved it as the road signn takes your attention away from the bull a bit. Would have also shot slightly lower as back feet are slightly cut off, there is more space at top of image so it would have been possible to do this.Nice shot though. (6)', '2004-04-16 04:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(671411, 69789, 16591, '<td valign="top">nice capture, have you try b/w? - 8</td>', 'nice capture, have you try b/w? - 8', '2004-04-16 05:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
