(671474, 69466, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, shame about the noise levels... did you try NeatImage? Used on the background you could really make the foreground pop out. Shame the ant isn''t sharper, I can see you''ve already tried sharpening in Photoshop.</td>', 'Great shot, shame about the noise levels... did you try NeatImage? Used on the background you could really make the foreground pop out. Shame the ant isn''t sharper, I can see you''ve already tried sharpening in Photoshop.', '2004-04-16 07:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(671475, 69883, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good panning, I don''t like the centred composition though.</td>', 'Great shot, good panning, I don''t like the centred composition though.', '2004-04-16 07:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(671476, 69908, 8522, '<td valign="top">Huh? Don''t get this at all.</td>', 'Huh? Don''t get this at all.', '2004-04-16 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(671484, 69148, 16004, '<td valign="top">Cute title, but technically not a wonderful picture...   I would imaging that you were not particularly inclined to pick up the mouse and place it in a more appealingly photogenic location, but it might have been worth trying to find a volunteer to do it as the environment is a little uninspiring.  I different viewpoint might have been worth exploring; seeing fluffy''s face instead of its arse would improve composition, methinks.  Colour would have been my preference (might make the cat more distinctive against the skirting), as would a bit more focus on the corpse.  had potential, is a good idea, could do with a little post editting (such a noise reduction with neatimage).</td>', 'Cute title, but technically not a wonderful picture...   I would imaging that you were not particularly inclined to pick up the mouse and place it in a more appealingly photogenic location, but it might have been worth trying to find a volunteer to do it as the environment is a little uninspiring.  I different viewpoint might have been worth exploring; seeing fluffy''s face instead of its arse would improve composition, methinks.  Colour would have been my preference (might make the cat more distinctive against the skirting), as would a bit more focus on the corpse.  had potential, is a good idea, could do with a little post editting (such a noise reduction with neatimage).', '2004-04-16 08:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(671485, 69559, 14055, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and message of this photo. However the quality of the picture and the composition could be better to make this a winner. maybe a more prominent focus on the woman 1th in line, taking the picture bending through your knees a bit too make her look bigger, (more strength) cutting of the feet of the other protestors in line would also remove the overexposed white line on the street. But nevertheless, I like this pic. keep up the good work!</td>', 'I like the colours and message of this photo. However the quality of the picture and the composition could be better to make this a winner. maybe a more prominent focus on the woman 1th in line, taking the picture bending through your knees a bit too make her look bigger, (more strength) cutting of the feet of the other protestors in line would also remove the overexposed white line on the street. But nevertheless, I like this pic. keep up the good work!', '2004-04-16 08:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(671490, 69748, 14055, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull picture! Have you considered taking the pic showing the faces of the subjects? That could have been an adition to the picture, giving it even more strength. Nevertheless its wonderfull and has great dynamics.</td>', 'Wonderfull picture! Have you considered taking the pic showing the faces of the subjects? That could have been an adition to the picture, giving it even more strength. Nevertheless its wonderfull and has great dynamics.', '2004-04-16 08:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
