(671613, 70142, 15919, '<td valign="top">Dont know if the egg is the reprentitation of strenght or is it the hand who brakes it?<br/>To be honest then I think this image is technically hopeless and everything else than eyecaching.  The main subject(s) are out of focus and if there is anything in focus than it is the background sheet.  Iron it next time.<br/>But dont give up and continue experimenting.</td>', 'Dont know if the egg is the reprentitation of strenght or is it the hand who brakes it?To be honest then I think this image is technically hopeless and everything else than eyecaching.  The main subject(s) are out of focus and if there is anything in focus than it is the background sheet.  Iron it next time.But dont give up and continue experimenting.', '2004-04-16 10:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
