(671646, 69880, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is actually a deceptively complicated shot - either you have many friends or you''re an octopus.  Might be more impressive if you added a whisp of guiness into the mix but still...   Stuff pouring from a bottle is ALWAYS photogenic when captured well, and i would say you''ve certainly done that.  Very well done - though it might be a tad sharper if a slightly shorter shutter time was used...  I like this, it fits the challenge and deserves to do well.  Only question is, did you drink the subject in question?</td>', 'This is actually a deceptively complicated shot - either you have many friends or you''re an octopus.  Might be more impressive if you added a whisp of guiness into the mix but still...   Stuff pouring from a bottle is ALWAYS photogenic when captured well, and i would say you''ve certainly done that.  Very well done - though it might be a tad sharper if a slightly shorter shutter time was used...  I like this, it fits the challenge and deserves to do well.  Only question is, did you drink the subject in question?', '2004-04-16 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
