(671671, 69636, 16004, '<td valign="top">Being agnostic / erring towards atheism, on a personal basis i can''t really relate to this shot.  However, I know a damn good picture when i see it, and see it i do.  I like muchly the lighting, the shadow cast across the page, and the quality of the image - focus, composition and DOF all, to me (an amateur with no talent) seems spot on.  I think that it could do with a slightly going over with neatimage to make the colours a bit bolder, but that aside, very good!  8.</td>', 'Being agnostic / erring towards atheism, on a personal basis i can''t really relate to this shot.  However, I know a damn good picture when i see it, and see it i do.  I like muchly the lighting, the shadow cast across the page, and the quality of the image - focus, composition and DOF all, to me (an amateur with no talent) seems spot on.  I think that it could do with a slightly going over with neatimage to make the colours a bit bolder, but that aside, very good!  8.', '2004-04-16 12:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
