(672394, 69217, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky shot.  I wish it was a larger photo, however.  Some people might think the color looks unnatural, but I like it.</td>', 'Lovely sky shot.  I wish it was a larger photo, however.  Some people might think the color looks unnatural, but I like it.', '2004-04-16 23:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
