(672400, 70179, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like this for the challenge.   I think the skin tone looks just a bit on the purplish side, though.  Still...I think the angle and expression are good.</td>', 'I really like this for the challenge.   I think the skin tone looks just a bit on the purplish side, though.  Still...I think the angle and expression are good.', '2004-04-16 23:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(672406, 69940, 15407, '<td valign="top">a much tighter composure on the front end of the car , perhaps a foot or so higher and a lighter exposure  would have highlighted the more interesting aspects of this automobile, the Z-lights, kidney grill, roundal, euro style plate and more detail on the chin spoiler would have done more justice to this ''BMW''.</td>', 'a much tighter composure on the front end of the car , perhaps a foot or so higher and a lighter exposure  would have highlighted the more interesting aspects of this automobile, the Z-lights, kidney grill, roundal, euro style plate and more detail on the chin spoiler would have done more justice to this ''BMW''.', '2004-04-16 23:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(672412, 69754, 15407, '<td valign="top">Good composure &amp; exposure from this POV... Is this a tall statue or where you down on the ground with this?  With the face looking down like it is one would think that this was the expected viewing angle, Where is it and what is the mechanical device.</td>', 'Good composure & exposure from this POV... Is this a tall statue or where you down on the ground with this?  With the face looking down like it is one would think that this was the expected viewing angle, Where is it and what is the mechanical device.', '2004-04-16 23:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
