(672426, 70151, 14891, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be rated higher if the ring around the guage was not casting a shadow into the guage itself. A bottom light source would have cured the shadow.</td>', 'I think this shot would be rated higher if the ring around the guage was not casting a shadow into the guage itself. A bottom light source would have cured the shadow.', '2004-04-16 23:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
