(672428, 69756, 14891, '<td valign="top">lots of moire grain on this, i''m not sure if that is what you were going for with the theme, but it sort of distracts from a very well framed photo. Also the whites are a bit washed out.</td>', 'lots of moire grain on this, i''m not sure if that is what you were going for with the theme, but it sort of distracts from a very well framed photo. Also the whites are a bit washed out.', '2004-04-16 23:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(672430, 69962, 15407, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composure using the rule of t3rds to get the focal point on the broken branch. My preferance clearly doesn''t go along with most voters on the site yet I would like to have seen this shot with the largest depth of field possible.</td>', 'Nice colors and composure using the rule of t3rds to get the focal point on the broken branch. My preferance clearly doesn''t go along with most voters on the site yet I would like to have seen this shot with the largest depth of field possible.', '2004-04-16 23:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(672432, 70059, 14891, '<td valign="top">Yeah... Unfortunately this has some text on it and it distracts from the canon. Perhaps a more angular shot of the canon would be better suited for this photo. I would have approached this from the ground up on an angle to show power (submissive when on the bottom) and that would also be in line with the challenge.<br/>The title is also mispelled.</td>', 'Yeah... Unfortunately this has some text on it and it distracts from the canon. Perhaps a more angular shot of the canon would be better suited for this photo. I would have approached this from the ground up on an angle to show power (submissive when on the bottom) and that would also be in line with the challenge.The title is also mispelled.', '2004-04-16 23:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
