(672443, 70145, 14891, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the feet are not nice to look at, the book is not level and the eggs would probably break because they are not on end, but who cares if they break. I think that this would rate higher if it was in b&amp;w and you adjusted the rotation of the photo to put the book at a straight horizoon. The whites seem to be a bit washed out on the book so B&amp;W would sort of be a more dramatic effect...and the feet, well.. umm.. yeah.</td>', 'Sorry but the feet are not nice to look at, the book is not level and the eggs would probably break because they are not on end, but who cares if they break. I think that this would rate higher if it was in b&w and you adjusted the rotation of the photo to put the book at a straight horizoon. The whites seem to be a bit washed out on the book so B&W would sort of be a more dramatic effect...and the feet, well.. umm.. yeah.', '2004-04-17 00:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(672444, 69458, 14526, '<td valign="top">maybe if the poor thing wasn''t being pressed against that rough beard???!</td>', 'maybe if the poor thing wasn''t being pressed against that rough beard???!', '2004-04-17 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
