(672446, 70109, 14891, '<td valign="top">So with the religious theme, i''m sure you''ll get either people that love it or people that hate it, I don''t hate it but don''t love it either. for composure 5 for subject 3.</td>', 'So with the religious theme, i''m sure you''ll get either people that love it or people that hate it, I don''t hate it but don''t love it either. for composure 5 for subject 3.', '2004-04-17 00:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
