(672453, 69768, 14891, '<td valign="top">The border is a bit thick for this. I have been accused of many "bad borders" So I''m sure that this photo will be rated lower because of the border. However, putting the border aside and not the photo. The sepia reminds me of old time photos where everyone was "strong" hence the stregnth challenge, the subject of a tree growing around a boulder is also very strong. I like the photo and rate it an 8. But the border that is a bit to bold for this photo.</td>', 'The border is a bit thick for this. I have been accused of many "bad borders" So I''m sure that this photo will be rated lower because of the border. However, putting the border aside and not the photo. The sepia reminds me of old time photos where everyone was "strong" hence the stregnth challenge, the subject of a tree growing around a boulder is also very strong. I like the photo and rate it an 8. But the border that is a bit to bold for this photo.', '2004-04-17 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(672454, 69679, 14526, '<td valign="top">why can I never get skies as blue as that?</td>', 'why can I never get skies as blue as that?', '2004-04-17 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(672455, 69781, 14891, '<td valign="top">Cute doggie but then again im a bit bias. Unfortuantely if the rott was a bit lighter and less over contrast this would have a more impact.</td>', 'Cute doggie but then again im a bit bias. Unfortuantely if the rott was a bit lighter and less over contrast this would have a more impact.', '2004-04-17 00:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(672458, 69231, 14891, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful photo. The correct balance of saturation, hue, contrast, composure and in line with this challenge. When I first viewed this photo I saw a weak subject, but as I look more and more at it, she gets stronger. This is a great photo. However, there are many here that may steal away from this well thought of and composed photo due to the religious beliefs or backgrounds. I''m voting 10. My first 10 and I''m almost done with the voting.</td>', 'This is a very powerful photo. The correct balance of saturation, hue, contrast, composure and in line with this challenge. When I first viewed this photo I saw a weak subject, but as I look more and more at it, she gets stronger. This is a great photo. However, there are many here that may steal away from this well thought of and composed photo due to the religious beliefs or backgrounds. I''m voting 10. My first 10 and I''m almost done with the voting.', '2004-04-17 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
