(672508, 69537, 8891, '<td valign="top">re shoot for silhouettes and see if it does as well there....nice biceps., the chest is a little uneven.  like the silhouette....not sure about the distraction of the background by the model''s right arm.</td>', 're shoot for silhouettes and see if it does as well there....nice biceps., the chest is a little uneven.  like the silhouette....not sure about the distraction of the background by the model''s right arm.', '2004-04-17 00:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(672509, 69030, 13487, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea... I think a different background would make this an excellent shot.  And a very minor thing... but the person''s reflection in the middle spoon bothers me a little.</td>', 'Very creative idea... I think a different background would make this an excellent shot.  And a very minor thing... but the person''s reflection in the middle spoon bothers me a little.', '2004-04-17 00:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(672510, 70074, 8891, '<td valign="top">The detail and colors of the eagle are quite good in this....the background leaves me cold.....fine image for the challenge them....though it looks like it''s bill had been broken and perhaps not as strong as it might be, the symbolism overrides that for me.</td>', 'The detail and colors of the eagle are quite good in this....the background leaves me cold.....fine image for the challenge them....though it looks like it''s bill had been broken and perhaps not as strong as it might be, the symbolism overrides that for me.', '2004-04-17 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(672513, 70074, 13487, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot but I''m not to big on the background.  It''s probably nothing you had any control over but if you''d put a sky or landscape background behind this, you''d have a definate winner.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot but I''m not to big on the background.  It''s probably nothing you had any control over but if you''d put a sky or landscape background behind this, you''d have a definate winner.', '2004-04-17 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
