(673275, 69654, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good use of the ROT and good leading lines. I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'Good use of the ROT and good leading lines. I like this shot a lot.', '2004-04-17 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(673277, 69148, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the cinema verite quality - but I wish the focus was clearer - either on the mouse or the cat''s face.</td>', 'I like the subject and the cinema verite quality - but I wish the focus was clearer - either on the mouse or the cat''s face.', '2004-04-17 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(673279, 69324, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the construction of the cross - that it seems to be reinforced by the lateral parts in the blocks instead of being a solid mass, it reinforces the theme, though the cracks in the middle find me worried about its durability</td>', 'I like the construction of the cross - that it seems to be reinforced by the lateral parts in the blocks instead of being a solid mass, it reinforces the theme, though the cracks in the middle find me worried about its durability', '2004-04-17 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(673292, 69537, 18361, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2004-04-17 22:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(673294, 69194, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, and the execution is good.  The only thing that troubles me is being able to clearly see the background reflected in the glass (ie: you taking the photo).  Other than that, great!</td>', 'I like your idea, and the execution is good.  The only thing that troubles me is being able to clearly see the background reflected in the glass (ie: you taking the photo).  Other than that, great!', '2004-04-17 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(673295, 70056, 19519, '<td valign="top">Definately reminds me of strength...  The b&amp;w works well with your subject, I think that maybe some more dof would worked better.  Overall, nice job!</td>', 'Definately reminds me of strength...  The b&w works well with your subject, I think that maybe some more dof would worked better.  Overall, nice job!', '2004-04-17 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(673298, 69836, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but maybe a different angle would have been better.  This angle kind of flattens out the cross.  The branches are a little bit interfering, and don''t really help with your message.  Religion is definately something that I would feel has strength...</td>', 'I like your idea, but maybe a different angle would have been better.  This angle kind of flattens out the cross.  The branches are a little bit interfering, and don''t really help with your message.  Religion is definately something that I would feel has strength...', '2004-04-17 22:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(673300, 69607, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrayal of strength.  The strength of the horses, and all those logs, it has a lot of natural, raw power to it.  The only thing that bothers me is the dark shadow in front of the horses, my eye keeps getting drawn to it.  Other than that, great job!!</td>', 'This is a nice portrayal of strength.  The strength of the horses, and all those logs, it has a lot of natural, raw power to it.  The only thing that bothers me is the dark shadow in front of the horses, my eye keeps getting drawn to it.  Other than that, great job!!', '2004-04-17 22:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(673303, 69787, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, though I do not like the shine on his goggles and mask.  I am not a fan of using a flash in this type of situation, because I don''t like the background shadows that it creates.  Maybe if you put your subject in a room with a darker backdrop, or farther away from the background, you could reduce or eliminate the shadows created here.  I do like the angle of your shot, and the way you have your model standing, and stretching out his hand, as if to fly!</td>', 'Interesting idea, though I do not like the shine on his goggles and mask.  I am not a fan of using a flash in this type of situation, because I don''t like the background shadows that it creates.  Maybe if you put your subject in a room with a darker backdrop, or farther away from the background, you could reduce or eliminate the shadows created here.  I do like the angle of your shot, and the way you have your model standing, and stretching out his hand, as if to fly!', '2004-04-17 22:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(673305, 69853, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a nice action shot,  I like look on the model''s face, the grimace of intense concentration.</td>', 'This is a nice action shot,  I like look on the model''s face, the grimace of intense concentration.', '2004-04-17 22:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(673306, 70126, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, I''m assuming you mean prayer.  This photo has a nice, simple look to it that I like, and the b&amp;w does well here, so you can focus on the meaning.  I think that the lighting is great, also!  Nice work!</td>', 'I like your idea, I''m assuming you mean prayer.  This photo has a nice, simple look to it that I like, and the b&w does well here, so you can focus on the meaning.  I think that the lighting is great, also!  Nice work!', '2004-04-17 22:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(673307, 69346, 12448, '<td valign="top">Perfect a 10</td>', 'Perfect a 10', '2004-04-17 22:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(673308, 69915, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, that is an interesting interpretation.  Someone standing on a crooked pier...I like the colors in this photo, the way the dock gradates from one color to the next.  The choppy water is nice too, and the branches hanging into the photo kind of point me back into the photo.  I like the repetition in the posts on the dock, and the posts contrasting with the dock also.  Nice work!</td>', 'I like the subject, that is an interesting interpretation.  Someone standing on a crooked pier...I like the colors in this photo, the way the dock gradates from one color to the next.  The choppy water is nice too, and the branches hanging into the photo kind of point me back into the photo.  I like the repetition in the posts on the dock, and the posts contrasting with the dock also.  Nice work!', '2004-04-17 22:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(673337, 69091, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t get it.The label should be brighter, on the technical aspect side.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t get it.The label should be brighter, on the technical aspect side.', '2004-04-17 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(673339, 69229, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like this idea of strength (was thinking of doing a tree myself), and you pulled it off well!  The contrast between the small boy (looking wayyyy up!) and the large, tall tree gives this photo a wonderful sense of awe.  The coloring and lighting in the photo complements the photo perfectly.  Great job!</td>', 'I like this idea of strength (was thinking of doing a tree myself), and you pulled it off well!  The contrast between the small boy (looking wayyyy up!) and the large, tall tree gives this photo a wonderful sense of awe.  The coloring and lighting in the photo complements the photo perfectly.  Great job!', '2004-04-17 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(673341, 69481, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nice action photo, good idea for the challenge.  The lighting is nice, although, I think that I would have liked to see the rest of the bottom of the flag, I think that it is leading my eye out of the photo with the bottom off the photo.  Otherwise, a good job!</td>', 'Nice action photo, good idea for the challenge.  The lighting is nice, although, I think that I would have liked to see the rest of the bottom of the flag, I think that it is leading my eye out of the photo with the bottom off the photo.  Otherwise, a good job!', '2004-04-17 23:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(673342, 69303, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the subject.</td>', 'I like the placement of the subject.', '2004-04-17 23:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(673343, 70123, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great scale here.</td>', 'Great scale here.', '2004-04-17 23:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(673346, 70151, 19519, '<td valign="top">I can kind of see where you were going with this, but not sure if it fits strength or power, as well as it fits pressure.  With just the guage showing, and no hint of what this guage is attached to, I find it hard to see the message.  Other than that, the photo is nice, I like the simple, soft colors, and the direction of the light works well with this subject.  I also like the straight pipe on the left, it is a nice contrast to the round guage.</td>', 'I can kind of see where you were going with this, but not sure if it fits strength or power, as well as it fits pressure.  With just the guage showing, and no hint of what this guage is attached to, I find it hard to see the message.  Other than that, the photo is nice, I like the simple, soft colors, and the direction of the light works well with this subject.  I also like the straight pipe on the left, it is a nice contrast to the round guage.', '2004-04-17 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(673347, 69910, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2004-04-17 23:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(673348, 70197, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, almost more of a funny photo.  The black and white does well with your subject.  I don''t know about the dark area in the upper left corner, though.  It''s kind of drawing me away a bit.  Overall, nice job!</td>', 'I like your idea, almost more of a funny photo.  The black and white does well with your subject.  I don''t know about the dark area in the upper left corner, though.  It''s kind of drawing me away a bit.  Overall, nice job!', '2004-04-17 23:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(673349, 69968, 19519, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!!  I love all the angles, and repetition in the trellise-work.  I also like the contrast of the natural background in the mountain, to all the rigid steel in the subject.  I think that the black and white does well here also.  Great job!</td>', 'Wonderful photo!!  I love all the angles, and repetition in the trellise-work.  I also like the contrast of the natural background in the mountain, to all the rigid steel in the subject.  I think that the black and white does well here also.  Great job!', '2004-04-17 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(673350, 69697, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea of strength, and I like your composition, and the lighting is very unique.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is a nice idea of strength, and I like your composition, and the lighting is very unique.  Nice work!', '2004-04-17 23:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(673352, 69725, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is cute!  But, I am not a fan of the shadows from a flash.  Maybe if you put him against a darker background, or a patterned background, to eliminate those harsh shadows, that white background is almost swallowing up your model.  Other than that, good job.</td>', 'This is cute!  But, I am not a fan of the shadows from a flash.  Maybe if you put him against a darker background, or a patterned background, to eliminate those harsh shadows, that white background is almost swallowing up your model.  Other than that, good job.', '2004-04-17 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(673355, 69774, 19519, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, I think that the sky is a bit too much negative space, though.  I do like the angle at which this photo was taken, and the way you incorperated the statue and building into the photo is great.  Good job.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, I think that the sky is a bit too much negative space, though.  I do like the angle at which this photo was taken, and the way you incorperated the statue and building into the photo is great.  Good job.', '2004-04-17 23:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(673358, 68976, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like the nostalgic feel of this photo.  The lighting is right, and it represents strength.  Nice work!</td>', 'I like the nostalgic feel of this photo.  The lighting is right, and it represents strength.  Nice work!', '2004-04-17 23:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(673360, 69756, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, although, I think that maybe it needs a slightly different approach to the lighting.  Some of the details are lost in the shadows.  I do like the way the colors play on the statue, though.</td>', 'This is a great idea, although, I think that maybe it needs a slightly different approach to the lighting.  Some of the details are lost in the shadows.  I do like the way the colors play on the statue, though.', '2004-04-17 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(673364, 69649, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo of a statue, the lighting is perfect.  It shows all the details in the statue, and the background is darker than the subject, thus highlighting the subject.  And, he was a strong leader!</td>', 'This is a nice photo of a statue, the lighting is perfect.  It shows all the details in the statue, and the background is darker than the subject, thus highlighting the subject.  And, he was a strong leader!', '2004-04-17 23:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(673367, 69994, 19519, '<td valign="top">There is not a whole lot of interest to this photo, but maybe with some more planning, it would have been an interesting idea...</td>', 'There is not a whole lot of interest to this photo, but maybe with some more planning, it would have been an interesting idea...', '2004-04-17 23:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(673371, 69103, 19519, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!  I love how you caught the open mouth on this eagle.  The compostion is nice, also, with the tree to the side.  I like the subtlety of the colors on the eagle.  Maybe a little dark, but overall, very nice!</td>', 'Wonderful photo!  I love how you caught the open mouth on this eagle.  The compostion is nice, also, with the tree to the side.  I like the subtlety of the colors on the eagle.  Maybe a little dark, but overall, very nice!', '2004-04-17 23:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(673372, 70105, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, though it doesn''t scream "Train" at me, it is an odd shot of a train.  Maybe more of the train in the photo would help.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, though it doesn''t scream "Train" at me, it is an odd shot of a train.  Maybe more of the train in the photo would help.', '2004-04-17 23:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(673373, 69917, 19012, '<td valign="top">Nice picture..</td>', 'Nice picture..', '2004-04-18 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(673374, 69679, 19012, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast of clouds with building...perspective is cool...</td>', 'Like the contrast of clouds with building...perspective is cool...', '2004-04-18 00:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(673375, 70160, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but the photo needs to be more crisp, and maybe it should be taken at an angle, for a little more interest.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but the photo needs to be more crisp, and maybe it should be taken at an angle, for a little more interest.', '2004-04-18 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(673376, 69750, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is nice, I like the green background, it works well here.  And, the model''s expression is perfect!  I think that the white band showing above the pants is distracting, though.  Other than that, nice job!</td>', 'This is nice, I like the green background, it works well here.  And, the model''s expression is perfect!  I think that the white band showing above the pants is distracting, though.  Other than that, nice job!', '2004-04-18 00:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(673378, 69636, 19519, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, the setup with the praying hands and the rosary is great, but I think that the candle is overpowering the shot.  Maybe you could increase the amount of ambient light to downplay the candle a little more.  The mirror underneath is a nice touch also.</td>', 'The idea is good, the setup with the praying hands and the rosary is great, but I think that the candle is overpowering the shot.  Maybe you could increase the amount of ambient light to downplay the candle a little more.  The mirror underneath is a nice touch also.', '2004-04-18 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(673379, 69363, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot!  The power required to lift that man up into the air like that is astounding.  Nice action shot!</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot!  The power required to lift that man up into the air like that is astounding.  Nice action shot!', '2004-04-18 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(673380, 69324, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Nice, simple photo, I like the angle.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Nice, simple photo, I like the angle.', '2004-04-18 00:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(673382, 69941, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I would have liked to see more of the horse, to feel the power of it.  This photo seems to show the calmness of this horse.  There maybe a bit too much shine on the fur, too, and some of the detail is lost.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I would have liked to see more of the horse, to feel the power of it.  This photo seems to show the calmness of this horse.  There maybe a bit too much shine on the fur, too, and some of the detail is lost.', '2004-04-18 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(673385, 69929, 19519, '<td valign="top">That is an interesting formation....  I like the ominous look of the whole photo.  Although, when it comes to strength/power, I think that a more lively tree might have been a better choice.  It is a wonderful photo, but maybe not for this challenge.</td>', 'That is an interesting formation....  I like the ominous look of the whole photo.  Although, when it comes to strength/power, I think that a more lively tree might have been a better choice.  It is a wonderful photo, but maybe not for this challenge.', '2004-04-18 00:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(673387, 69609, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, except the "stuff" in the background is distracting...</td>', 'Nice photo, except the "stuff" in the background is distracting...', '2004-04-18 00:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(673388, 69747, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and nicely exacuted.  I like the fact that you can see all that background behind the hands.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and nicely exacuted.  I like the fact that you can see all that background behind the hands.', '2004-04-18 00:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(673390, 69679, 19519, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subject, but the composition isn''t quite right, there is an awful lot of negative space all around the building, and I think that is hurting your photo.  The sky itself is nice (as in the time of day was a good choice).</td>', 'I like your choice of subject, but the composition isn''t quite right, there is an awful lot of negative space all around the building, and I think that is hurting your photo.  The sky itself is nice (as in the time of day was a good choice).', '2004-04-18 00:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(673393, 69997, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo, the black and white goes well with this photo.  I like the position of your model.  Nice work, definately portrays strength!</td>', 'This is an interesting photo, the black and white goes well with this photo.  I like the position of your model.  Nice work, definately portrays strength!', '2004-04-18 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
