(673902, 69526, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground composition. The amount of space in the background, which kind of connects with a fairly large open area between the weights, pulls the eye away from the central theme. I would have cropped the picture tighter at the top. Overall, it is a good shot; nice capture of the metallic textures.</td>', 'I like the foreground composition. The amount of space in the background, which kind of connects with a fairly large open area between the weights, pulls the eye away from the central theme. I would have cropped the picture tighter at the top. Overall, it is a good shot; nice capture of the metallic textures.', '2004-04-18 13:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(673907, 69774, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the theme, and a very striking photo. Nice shot. At the risk of showing an ignorance of world events I''ll have to ask who is the statue?</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the theme, and a very striking photo. Nice shot. At the risk of showing an ignorance of world events I''ll have to ask who is the statue?', '2004-04-18 13:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
