(673911, 68825, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good technique, but I think I would like the composition better if our Hero wasn''t crammed in the corner.    Perhpaps tilting the camera a little so that he is leaning back to look up into the sky (or at least standing straight)  and cropping with a bit more air behind him.</td>', 'Good technique, but I think I would like the composition better if our Hero wasn''t crammed in the corner.    Perhpaps tilting the camera a little so that he is leaning back to look up into the sky (or at least standing straight)  and cropping with a bit more air behind him.', '2004-04-18 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(673912, 69849, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brillian colors, but they look a bit oversaturated. Is the bird really that blue? This is certainly a different take on the theme.</td>', 'Brillian colors, but they look a bit oversaturated. Is the bird really that blue? This is certainly a different take on the theme.', '2004-04-18 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(673915, 69056, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of the power of machinery and the texture and sheen of metals. IMHO it could have used more DOF to bring one of the other supports into focus.</td>', 'Great feeling of the power of machinery and the texture and sheen of metals. IMHO it could have used more DOF to bring one of the other supports into focus.', '2004-04-18 13:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(673916, 68870, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the curved road and the pillars. I think the building in the background detracts from the powerful effect and unity of forms.</td>', 'I like the composition of the curved road and the pillars. I think the building in the background detracts from the powerful effect and unity of forms.', '2004-04-18 13:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(673917, 69945, 12733, '<td valign="top">Power or terror??? The soft focus and color convey an emotion, but to my eye are overdone.</td>', 'Power or terror??? The soft focus and color convey an emotion, but to my eye are overdone.', '2004-04-18 13:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(673919, 69633, 12733, '<td valign="top">The name on the door says it all. Very good texture rendition and interesting colors.</td>', 'The name on the door says it all. Very good texture rendition and interesting colors.', '2004-04-18 13:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(673920, 69295, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette against a pretty sky. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great silhouette against a pretty sky. Nice shot.', '2004-04-18 13:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(673922, 69194, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the theme. Nice lighting to bring out the glass textures and the bright white of the cards.</td>', 'An interesting take on the theme. Nice lighting to bring out the glass textures and the bright white of the cards.', '2004-04-18 13:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(673925, 69951, 12733, '<td valign="top">The colors and shapes are interesting, but what is this a picture of? How does it relate to the title and the theme of the challenge? Viewers should not have to guess.</td>', 'The colors and shapes are interesting, but what is this a picture of? How does it relate to the title and the theme of the challenge? Viewers should not have to guess.', '2004-04-18 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(673928, 69466, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is the ant really holding up the blade of grass as it appears? These truly are strong little creatures, and this is an amazing portrait of one.</td>', 'Is the ant really holding up the blade of grass as it appears? These truly are strong little creatures, and this is an amazing portrait of one.', '2004-04-18 14:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(673932, 69864, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, nice capture on the flame. What is the surround?</td>', 'Pretty colors, nice capture on the flame. What is the surround?', '2004-04-18 14:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(673936, 69979, 20029, '<td valign="top">rain did that?</td>', 'rain did that?', '2004-04-18 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(673940, 69985, 12733, '<td valign="top">If knowledge is power, why is the definition of know-it-all, a perjorative phrase indicating someone who pretends to have power, but really doesn''t, in focus and the bulk of the definition of knowledge out of focus? I think more DOF, or a centering of focus on the definition of knowledge, would have made more sense.</td>', 'If knowledge is power, why is the definition of know-it-all, a perjorative phrase indicating someone who pretends to have power, but really doesn''t, in focus and the bulk of the definition of knowledge out of focus? I think more DOF, or a centering of focus on the definition of knowledge, would have made more sense.', '2004-04-18 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(673941, 70059, 20029, '<td valign="top">"strenght" is spelled strength!</td>', '"strenght" is spelled strength!', '2004-04-18 14:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(673944, 70123, 20029, '<td valign="top">This is one of my ribbon pics!10</td>', 'This is one of my ribbon pics!10', '2004-04-18 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(673948, 69294, 12733, '<td valign="top">This would be a real winner if it were not for the out-of-focus, headless figure on the bridge. Cropping almost level with the tops of the kids'' heads would have solved this problem.</td>', 'This would be a real winner if it were not for the out-of-focus, headless figure on the bridge. Cropping almost level with the tops of the kids'' heads would have solved this problem.', '2004-04-18 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(673950, 69728, 12733, '<td valign="top">I find the background too dark to really see the details. And where''s the diploma????</td>', 'I find the background too dark to really see the details. And where''s the diploma????', '2004-04-18 14:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(673955, 69889, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and a creative take on the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and a creative take on the challenge.', '2004-04-18 14:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(673958, 68996, 11248, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The parallel between the nature and the technology is ashtonishing. Good luck. -10</td>', 'Great composition. The parallel between the nature and the technology is ashtonishing. Good luck. -10', '2004-04-18 14:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(673961, 69748, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very interresting picture for this topic. I would prefer to see their faces but anyway it''s one of the best picture in this challenge. -9<br/></td>', 'Very interresting picture for this topic. I would prefer to see their faces but anyway it''s one of the best picture in this challenge. -9', '2004-04-18 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(673963, 70190, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice wrestling shot, but I think the expressions on the wrestlers'' faces would make a far better shot.</td>', 'Nice wrestling shot, but I think the expressions on the wrestlers'' faces would make a far better shot.', '2004-04-18 14:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(673964, 69883, 11248, '<td valign="top">Original and well taken. Good luck. -9<br/></td>', 'Original and well taken. Good luck. -9', '2004-04-18 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(673965, 70067, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and lighting. Good luck. -8<br/></td>', 'Very good composition and lighting. Good luck. -8', '2004-04-18 14:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(673967, 69853, 11248, '<td valign="top">An impressive demonstration of strenght.   -8<br/></td>', 'An impressive demonstration of strenght.   -8', '2004-04-18 14:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(673968, 69889, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very original and beautiful demonstration of nature strenght. -8<br/></td>', 'Very original and beautiful demonstration of nature strenght. -8', '2004-04-18 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(673973, 69960, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge, and an interesting angle that shows the engine well. I think a good cleaning of the engine would make this a better shot. And, of course, a V-8 engine with bright chromed valve covers would better illustrate the muscle of an American super-powered car.</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge, and an interesting angle that shows the engine well. I think a good cleaning of the engine would make this a better shot. And, of course, a V-8 engine with bright chromed valve covers would better illustrate the muscle of an American super-powered car.', '2004-04-18 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(673976, 70055, 11248, '<td valign="top">Original view of strenght. Good colors and sharpness. Very good lighting. Don''t like the red frame... too large.  -8</td>', 'Original view of strenght. Good colors and sharpness. Very good lighting. Don''t like the red frame... too large.  -8', '2004-04-18 14:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(673977, 69903, 12733, '<td valign="top">The blur and the bright color really emphasize the power of amlified music.</td>', 'The blur and the bright color really emphasize the power of amlified music.', '2004-04-18 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(673982, 69636, 15920, '<td valign="top">The shadow off the cross is great.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'The shadow off the cross is great.  Nice lighting.', '2004-04-18 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(673985, 68857, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great detaill in the hads and the tablets - excellent DOF. But overall, I don''t find the picture very interesting.</td>', 'Great detaill in the hads and the tablets - excellent DOF. But overall, I don''t find the picture very interesting.', '2004-04-18 14:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(673989, 70051, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I lke the way the kids at the base give a sense of scale, but the seated figures under the statue''s had are a distinct distraction.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I lke the way the kids at the base give a sense of scale, but the seated figures under the statue''s had are a distinct distraction.', '2004-04-18 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(673992, 69941, 12733, '<td valign="top">The extreme closeup reveals a ot of detail, but it also creates an odd juxtaposition of shapes - the portion of the horse''s face and the ground.</td>', 'The extreme closeup reveals a ot of detail, but it also creates an odd juxtaposition of shapes - the portion of the horse''s face and the ground.', '2004-04-18 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(673995, 70162, 12733, '<td valign="top">I fought the law and the law won. Nice rendition of the textures, and a nice composition with the pillars and the doorway.</td>', 'I fought the law and the law won. Nice rendition of the textures, and a nice composition with the pillars and the doorway.', '2004-04-18 14:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(673997, 69892, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot and nice action capture. I would have liked more whale and less sky.</td>', 'A very interesting shot and nice action capture. I would have liked more whale and less sky.', '2004-04-18 14:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(673998, 70072, 12733, '<td valign="top">The beautifully polished metal comes across well, but at the same time catches distracting highlights.</td>', 'The beautifully polished metal comes across well, but at the same time catches distracting highlights.', '2004-04-18 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(673999, 69932, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting illustration of overkill, and a nicely composed photo. What kind of a machine is that, anyway?</td>', 'An interesting illustration of overkill, and a nicely composed photo. What kind of a machine is that, anyway?', '2004-04-18 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(674002, 69541, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice, quiet picture. I wish you had used the full picture and file size allowed to bring out the dtail better.</td>', 'A nice, quiet picture. I wish you had used the full picture and file size allowed to bring out the dtail better.', '2004-04-18 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(674006, 69743, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and interesting site.</td>', 'Very nice composition and interesting site.', '2004-04-18 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(674007, 69957, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and color. Certainly a creative take on the challenge theme.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and color. Certainly a creative take on the challenge theme.', '2004-04-18 14:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(674010, 68969, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful choice of point of view to emphasize the strength of the tree.</td>', 'Beautiful choice of point of view to emphasize the strength of the tree.', '2004-04-18 14:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(674012, 69061, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the splashing water. I like the expressions on the kids'' faces.</td>', 'Great capture of the splashing water. I like the expressions on the kids'' faces.', '2004-04-18 14:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(674017, 70164, 12733, '<td valign="top">Birds are hard enough to capture - but two interacting, with good composition as well - a great shot.</td>', 'Birds are hard enough to capture - but two interacting, with good composition as well - a great shot.', '2004-04-18 14:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(674019, 70066, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of angle to emphasize the engine. Since the rules are for basic editing, you couldn''t take out the shadowy mountains in the background, which are slightly distracting.</td>', 'Nice choice of angle to emphasize the engine. Since the rules are for basic editing, you couldn''t take out the shadowy mountains in the background, which are slightly distracting.', '2004-04-18 14:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674024, 69968, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendition of forms.</td>', 'Beautiful rendition of forms.', '2004-04-18 15:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(674026, 70059, 12733, '<td valign="top">The colors and textures of the gun are well rendered. From a composition point of view, I think the pucture would be far more expressive shooting straight into the barrel. And the red date stamp can ruin any picture; there has to be a way to shut it off.</td>', 'The colors and textures of the gun are well rendered. From a composition point of view, I think the pucture would be far more expressive shooting straight into the barrel. And the red date stamp can ruin any picture; there has to be a way to shut it off.', '2004-04-18 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(674027, 70133, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great humor, nice choice of vantage point to take the photo and good choice of black and white. One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Great humor, nice choice of vantage point to take the photo and good choice of black and white. One of the best in this challenge.', '2004-04-18 15:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(674029, 69697, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color and lighting.</td>', 'Brilliant color and lighting.', '2004-04-18 15:09:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(674030, 69340, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of the power of a steam engine, and great rendition of metallic textures. IMHO cropping out the bright background, including a little of the front of the locomotive, would strengthen the picture.</td>', 'Nice sense of the power of a steam engine, and great rendition of metallic textures. IMHO cropping out the bright background, including a little of the front of the locomotive, would strengthen the picture.', '2004-04-18 15:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(674031, 70145, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting question; what was the result? Nice detail, I''m not sure what disturbs me about the composition - possibly too centered.</td>', 'Interesting question; what was the result? Nice detail, I''m not sure what disturbs me about the composition - possibly too centered.', '2004-04-18 15:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(674033, 70087, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors, textures and detail.</td>', 'I really like the colors, textures and detail.', '2004-04-18 15:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(674035, 70168, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really interesting, emphasizing a few details and blending the rest into the black background.</td>', 'The lighting is really interesting, emphasizing a few details and blending the rest into the black background.', '2004-04-18 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(674037, 68823, 12733, '<td valign="top">Just enough motion blur, but not too much. The background is kind of distracting, that''s unfortunate.</td>', 'Just enough motion blur, but not too much. The background is kind of distracting, that''s unfortunate.', '2004-04-18 15:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(674038, 70061, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and expression of the old game.</td>', 'Nice composition and expression of the old game.', '2004-04-18 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(674039, 70092, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice, straight on portrait. Is there something wrong with his eye? The white seems out of place.</td>', 'Nice, straight on portrait. Is there something wrong with his eye? The white seems out of place.', '2004-04-18 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(674040, 69982, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and contrast of forms and textures.</td>', 'Great DOF and contrast of forms and textures.', '2004-04-18 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(674042, 69738, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great expression and an unusual take on the challenge. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great expression and an unusual take on the challenge. Nice shot.', '2004-04-18 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(674044, 69761, 2716, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of my favorites.  Great shot.  Made me smile.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'This has to be one of my favorites.  Great shot.  Made me smile.  Jacko.  10', '2004-04-18 15:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(674046, 69846, 12733, '<td valign="top">More strength than we''re ready to handle, and more tragedy than the original blast (fallout and depleted unranium weapons). Nice capture of the painted surface, and a great idea for the challenge.</td>', 'More strength than we''re ready to handle, and more tragedy than the original blast (fallout and depleted unranium weapons). Nice capture of the painted surface, and a great idea for the challenge.', '2004-04-18 15:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(674047, 69116, 16230, '<td valign="top">The wings are too blury. :)<br/> <br/>I was trying to photograph some bees on flowers yesterday. I was lucky to even get a bee in the frame, and none turned out this good. Nice photo!<br/></td>', 'The wings are too blury. :) I was trying to photograph some bees on flowers yesterday. I was lucky to even get a bee in the frame, and none turned out this good. Nice photo!', '2004-04-18 15:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(674050, 69229, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! It fits the challenge nicely. The child looking up was a good idea. Is this a Sitka Spruce, or something else?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-21 01:11:35.</i></td>', 'Nice photo! It fits the challenge nicely. The child looking up was a good idea. Is this a Sitka Spruce, or something else?', '2004-04-18 15:44:10.000000', '2004-04-21 02:11:35.000000', 1),
(674053, 70154, 12733, '<td valign="top">A different and creative interpretation of the challenge. A beautiful smile of joy and a nice choice of setting.  My only criticism would be some apparent wide-angle distortion on the face.</td>', 'A different and creative interpretation of the challenge. A beautiful smile of joy and a nice choice of setting.  My only criticism would be some apparent wide-angle distortion on the face.', '2004-04-18 15:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(674055, 69494, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of the turtle. I especially like the rendition of texture.</td>', 'Great portrait of the turtle. I especially like the rendition of texture.', '2004-04-18 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(674056, 70186, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the statue. A closer vantage point and steeper upward angle might have emphasized the sense of power more. And IMHO a tall, narrow crop would also emphasize the strength represented by this statue.</td>', 'Nice shot of the statue. A closer vantage point and steeper upward angle might have emphasized the sense of power more. And IMHO a tall, narrow crop would also emphasize the strength represented by this statue.', '2004-04-18 15:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(674059, 69852, 12733, '<td valign="top">Yes, the power of plants to find a niche in apparently solid rock is amazing. I think this needs more DOF to show the inhospitable background and the leafy stems.</td>', 'Yes, the power of plants to find a niche in apparently solid rock is amazing. I think this needs more DOF to show the inhospitable background and the leafy stems.', '2004-04-18 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(674061, 69783, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tiger, nicely framed and photographed. I like the sense of detail and the excellent DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful tiger, nicely framed and photographed. I like the sense of detail and the excellent DOF.', '2004-04-18 15:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(674062, 69501, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nope. Nice shot - great pose, nice detail, good placement for the composition. I only wish he didn''t have that dark shadow across his eyes.</td>', 'Nope. Nice shot - great pose, nice detail, good placement for the composition. I only wish he didn''t have that dark shadow across his eyes.', '2004-04-18 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(674065, 69911, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and I agree with the sentiment. It needs a tighter crop at the top.</td>', 'Nice shot, and I agree with the sentiment. It needs a tighter crop at the top.', '2004-04-18 16:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(674066, 70143, 12733, '<td valign="top">One of nature''s natural acrobats and comedians. Nice capture.</td>', 'One of nature''s natural acrobats and comedians. Nice capture.', '2004-04-18 16:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(674067, 68976, 12733, '<td valign="top">The gun isn''t wooden; it''s clearly iron. The frame is wooden. A nice composition - glad you resisted the urge to include the whole wheel. It makes a better shot with part of it cut off.</td>', 'The gun isn''t wooden; it''s clearly iron. The frame is wooden. A nice composition - glad you resisted the urge to include the whole wheel. It makes a better shot with part of it cut off.', '2004-04-18 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(674082, 69732, 5364, '<td valign="top">This could be a realy good picture, but you need to have her eyes in focus, rather than her ear.</td>', 'This could be a realy good picture, but you need to have her eyes in focus, rather than her ear.', '2004-04-18 16:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(674086, 69485, 5364, '<td valign="top">Could you have taken this from a lower angle to remove the horizon from over the face? - nice picture otherwise</td>', 'Could you have taken this from a lower angle to remove the horizon from over the face? - nice picture otherwise', '2004-04-18 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(674088, 69750, 5364, '<td valign="top">It may be fashionable to show your underwear, but here the bright white is very distracting, which is a pity, because this is a good image otherwise</td>', 'It may be fashionable to show your underwear, but here the bright white is very distracting, which is a pity, because this is a good image otherwise', '2004-04-18 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(674090, 69754, 18505, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.</td>', 'Very interesting image.', '2004-04-18 16:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(674092, 69783, 63, '<td valign="top">I would like to see better focus on the face. A very good shot of a powerful animal.</td>', 'I would like to see better focus on the face. A very good shot of a powerful animal.', '2004-04-18 17:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(674093, 69231, 18505, '<td valign="top">Incredible portrait.  You get a 10 from me.</td>', 'Incredible portrait.  You get a 10 from me.', '2004-04-18 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(674096, 69944, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is a bit over-exposed, but a good idea</td>', 'This is a bit over-exposed, but a good idea', '2004-04-18 17:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(674107, 69038, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you really need all that road in the foreground, and I find it rather distracting that the vertical poles are leaning over to the right.</td>', 'I don''t think you really need all that road in the foreground, and I find it rather distracting that the vertical poles are leaning over to the right.', '2004-04-18 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(674111, 69853, 11068, '<td valign="top">I think this is power, beautifull actionpicture, love the expression on the persons face on the right.</td>', 'I think this is power, beautifull actionpicture, love the expression on the persons face on the right.', '2004-04-18 17:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(674134, 69362, 14656, '<td valign="top">I only wish the image of popeye wasn''t so jaggy, everything else is clean and beautiful!</td>', 'I only wish the image of popeye wasn''t so jaggy, everything else is clean and beautiful!', '2004-04-18 18:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(674135, 69231, 16636, '<td valign="top">lovelly evocative image</td>', 'lovelly evocative image', '2004-04-18 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(674136, 70083, 14656, '<td valign="top">Simply breathtaking!</td>', 'Simply breathtaking!', '2004-04-18 18:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(674137, 69116, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent bee macro! I always have a hard time getting close enough. The bee either flies away as the camera approaches, or they turn and fly towards me sending me running off in a panic :D</td>', 'Excellent bee macro! I always have a hard time getting close enough. The bee either flies away as the camera approaches, or they turn and fly towards me sending me running off in a panic :D', '2004-04-18 18:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(674138, 69627, 14656, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call strong! Interested to know how you kept the spoon upright.</td>', 'Now that''s what I call strong! Interested to know how you kept the spoon upright.', '2004-04-18 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(674140, 69831, 14656, '<td valign="top">After reading the title and assuming these are dental tools, this pic gave me the shudders! Any reason why you chose the blue tone for this image? I''m not sure I like it and would have prefered to see the image with the correct white balance or in plain black and white.</td>', 'After reading the title and assuming these are dental tools, this pic gave me the shudders! Any reason why you chose the blue tone for this image? I''m not sure I like it and would have prefered to see the image with the correct white balance or in plain black and white.', '2004-04-18 18:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(674141, 69039, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great image! I''m quite fond of the persistence of plants growing through pavement as well :)</td>', 'Great image! I''m quite fond of the persistence of plants growing through pavement as well :)', '2004-04-18 18:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674144, 69896, 14656, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to see brighter highlights in this otherwise great photo. The turkey(?) in the background is an interesting touch, but I think it''s a bit distracting although it plays on your subconscious by association (quitting cold turkey). Also not sure about the rock(?) with the ribbon tied to it in the ashtray. This image is just full of mystery!</td>', 'I would''ve liked to see brighter highlights in this otherwise great photo. The turkey(?) in the background is an interesting touch, but I think it''s a bit distracting although it plays on your subconscious by association (quitting cold turkey). Also not sure about the rock(?) with the ribbon tied to it in the ashtray. This image is just full of mystery!', '2004-04-18 18:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(674146, 69537, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great photo! The right half seems to feel heavier though, because of the tree in the middle ground and your model is not perfectly symmetrical. He appears to be right handed from the larger "gun" assuming we are looking at him from behind. Not trying to be nitpicky, but perhaps he could''ve rotated slightly to his left to bring things into proportion?</td>', 'Great photo! The right half seems to feel heavier though, because of the tree in the middle ground and your model is not perfectly symmetrical. He appears to be right handed from the larger "gun" assuming we are looking at him from behind. Not trying to be nitpicky, but perhaps he could''ve rotated slightly to his left to bring things into proportion?', '2004-04-18 18:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(674148, 69480, 14656, '<td valign="top">Yes, master!</td>', 'Yes, master!', '2004-04-18 18:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(674150, 69317, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition although I would''ve liked to see a little more lustre in the rings and a little less contrast. Perhaps softening the image would''ve helped? Instead, it seems a tad oversharpened.</td>', 'Excellent composition although I would''ve liked to see a little more lustre in the rings and a little less contrast. Perhaps softening the image would''ve helped? Instead, it seems a tad oversharpened.', '2004-04-18 18:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(674151, 70166, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2004-04-18 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
