(674167, 68937, 14656, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but I think mostly everyone will agree this has got to be the most overused technique here on DPC. I give this a 1 for creativity. On top of that, the image overall lacks sharpness and the entire photo seems out of focus. I would''ve admired brighter highlights for this as well, 3 for technicality.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but I think mostly everyone will agree this has got to be the most overused technique here on DPC. I give this a 1 for creativity. On top of that, the image overall lacks sharpness and the entire photo seems out of focus. I would''ve admired brighter highlights for this as well, 3 for technicality.', '2004-04-18 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
