(674173, 70159, 14656, '<td valign="top">Tilted horizons usually bother me unless it was very deliberate and blatant such as a 45° angle. It''s a shame that the sand came out underexposed as well, this looks like a beautiful beach. Wondering what camera you used for this shot, the image appears noisy.</td>', 'Tilted horizons usually bother me unless it was very deliberate and blatant such as a 45° angle. It''s a shame that the sand came out underexposed as well, this looks like a beautiful beach. Wondering what camera you used for this shot, the image appears noisy.', '2004-04-18 19:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
