(674739, 68877, 18852, '<td valign="top">I personally feel that cirrus clouds detract from a picture rather than add to it.  Cumulus clouds would have been much better, but I like the three tiered effect.  Having it centered makes it seem somewhat ordinary, though.</td>', 'I personally feel that cirrus clouds detract from a picture rather than add to it.  Cumulus clouds would have been much better, but I like the three tiered effect.  Having it centered makes it seem somewhat ordinary, though.', '2004-04-19 02:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
