(674813, 70059, 18852, '<td valign="top">color slightly washed out.  it seems like this is a new/your first camera and you are just getting used to it.  turn the date stamp off.  it seems useful, but your files are already tagged with the date while they are in the camera.</td>', 'color slightly washed out.  it seems like this is a new/your first camera and you are just getting used to it.  turn the date stamp off.  it seems useful, but your files are already tagged with the date while they are in the camera.', '2004-04-19 03:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(674816, 68825, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really interesting picture. To my eyes, the subject is just too far over in the corner and there''s too much empty space.</td>', 'Really interesting picture. To my eyes, the subject is just too far over in the corner and there''s too much empty space.', '2004-04-19 03:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(674819, 69549, 18852, '<td valign="top">it is nice to see b/w  I don''t think there''s enough contrast.  that seems to be a problem with many digital cameras:(</td>', 'it is nice to see b/w  I don''t think there''s enough contrast.  that seems to be a problem with many digital cameras:(', '2004-04-19 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
