(675464, 69335, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good angel and technically it seems pretty good.  Find the color of the sky a litle strange.  Don´t know what your equipments are but think that polarizing filter would have come in hand there or use some other kind of exposure evaluation or maybe the WB isn´t the best.  If it would have possible I think this could have been better if we would only have seen the sky in the background thou I´m not saying that the trees on the right are distracting.<br/>This is an OK image of a car but I dont know how creative representation of strenght and power it is.</td>', 'Good angel and technically it seems pretty good.  Find the color of the sky a litle strange.  Don´t know what your equipments are but think that polarizing filter would have come in hand there or use some other kind of exposure evaluation or maybe the WB isn´t the best.  If it would have possible I think this could have been better if we would only have seen the sky in the background thou I´m not saying that the trees on the right are distracting.This is an OK image of a car but I dont know how creative representation of strenght and power it is.', '2004-04-19 12:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(675481, 69999, 19222, '<td valign="top">Probably the best statue picture I''ve seen for this contest so far...very subtle, nice angle, very artistic. I love the focus on the hand, which is where the power truly lies. Beautiful picture.</td>', 'Probably the best statue picture I''ve seen for this contest so far...very subtle, nice angle, very artistic. I love the focus on the hand, which is where the power truly lies. Beautiful picture.', '2004-04-19 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
