(675706, 69541, 17983, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like the composition better if the two people weren''t dead center.  Perhaps moving them more to the left and showing more road in front of them.  I like your interpretation of the challenge.  Also, it might work better if the image were sharper... but hard to tell on the small size.  I too made the mistake of submitting too small of an image on my first submission, and got beat up pretty bad for it! :)  Overall, I like it.</td>', 'I think I''d like the composition better if the two people weren''t dead center.  Perhaps moving them more to the left and showing more road in front of them.  I like your interpretation of the challenge.  Also, it might work better if the image were sharper... but hard to tell on the small size.  I too made the mistake of submitting too small of an image on my first submission, and got beat up pretty bad for it! :)  Overall, I like it.', '2004-04-19 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(675714, 70156, 17983, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, DOF, concept and point of view.  Not entirely sold on the color  treatment, however.</td>', 'I like the composition, DOF, concept and point of view.  Not entirely sold on the color  treatment, however.', '2004-04-19 14:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
