(676174, 69882, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a creative and unusual interpretation! I like it. Wonderful textures and the shapes of the chevron are very striking.</td>', 'What a creative and unusual interpretation! I like it. Wonderful textures and the shapes of the chevron are very striking.', '2004-04-19 17:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(676177, 70192, 3087, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft or there is motion blur - not sure which.<br/>I am not a religious person so this image doesn''t connect with me on an emotional level as strongly as it might with others.<br/>I do think the backlighting is an excellent choice and composition is also strong.</td>', 'Focus is soft or there is motion blur - not sure which.I am not a religious person so this image doesn''t connect with me on an emotional level as strongly as it might with others.I do think the backlighting is an excellent choice and composition is also strong.', '2004-04-19 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(676181, 70133, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint - very unusual and creates a quirky frame. Nice use of repetition and good choice to go black and white.</td>', 'Great viewpoint - very unusual and creates a quirky frame. Nice use of repetition and good choice to go black and white.', '2004-04-19 17:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(676183, 69485, 3087, '<td valign="top">My first reaction is that this is really about someone else''s creativity and artwork rather than your own. That said the viewpoint you have chosen makes for a very striking composition and the subtly toned black and white is also very flattering.</td>', 'My first reaction is that this is really about someone else''s creativity and artwork rather than your own. That said the viewpoint you have chosen makes for a very striking composition and the subtly toned black and white is also very flattering.', '2004-04-19 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(676196, 69344, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea. I love globes so I am drawn to this entry. I think lighting could be more even but then again the dark shadows provide a little more drama.</td>', 'An interesting idea. I love globes so I am drawn to this entry. I think lighting could be more even but then again the dark shadows provide a little more drama.', '2004-04-19 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(676197, 69849, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Fantastic colour. I just returned recently from Africa and saw many birds eating snakes and frogs but none with such a vivid blue colouring. And his beak too! I think a wider DOF would benefit this image.</td>', 'Wow! Fantastic colour. I just returned recently from Africa and saw many birds eating snakes and frogs but none with such a vivid blue colouring. And his beak too! I think a wider DOF would benefit this image.', '2004-04-19 17:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(676198, 70043, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely interpretation and one I agree with wholeheartedly. A lovely image too and the off-centre composition, with the fanned leaves providing balance, works well.</td>', 'A lovely interpretation and one I agree with wholeheartedly. A lovely image too and the off-centre composition, with the fanned leaves providing balance, works well.', '2004-04-19 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(676203, 69466, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Nice shallow DOF - creates a wonderful dappled background. Focus doesn''t seem sharp enough on the ant itself.</td>', 'Great idea! Nice shallow DOF - creates a wonderful dappled background. Focus doesn''t seem sharp enough on the ant itself.', '2004-04-19 17:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(676205, 70123, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and such a sense of drama and power. Wonderful.</td>', 'Excellent composition and such a sense of drama and power. Wonderful.', '2004-04-19 17:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(676208, 69494, 3087, '<td valign="top">Textures and colours are fascinating - from the orange lichen on the bark to the red and grey shell to the yellow, red and black patterns of it''s skin. Composition is excellent too.</td>', 'Textures and colours are fascinating - from the orange lichen on the bark to the red and grey shell to the yellow, red and black patterns of it''s skin. Composition is excellent too.', '2004-04-19 17:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(676211, 69371, 3087, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the two people really makes this work since there would be no sense of scale or drama without them. I like your choice to go for high contrast black and white.</td>', 'The inclusion of the two people really makes this work since there would be no sense of scale or drama without them. I like your choice to go for high contrast black and white.', '2004-04-19 17:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(676213, 70120, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love leading lines as well as wonderful shapes and textures. This is so simple it''s the kind of image I can imagine having a small haiku poem printed on it - in that top right corner. Good choice to go for black and white.</td>', 'I love leading lines as well as wonderful shapes and textures. This is so simple it''s the kind of image I can imagine having a small haiku poem printed on it - in that top right corner. Good choice to go for black and white.', '2004-04-19 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(676217, 69697, 3087, '<td valign="top">The lighting is what lifts this out of the ordinary. What a creative choice of light source and I love the way in which it is included in the image to provide a rounded shape to counter the straight diagonal edge of the document.</td>', 'The lighting is what lifts this out of the ordinary. What a creative choice of light source and I love the way in which it is included in the image to provide a rounded shape to counter the straight diagonal edge of the document.', '2004-04-19 18:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(676220, 69997, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting isn''t idea = too strong for my preference. But content is great - the wall itself makes a really quirky background and I love the way we can see his muscles straining.</td>', 'Lighting isn''t idea = too strong for my preference. But content is great - the wall itself makes a really quirky background and I love the way we can see his muscles straining.', '2004-04-19 18:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(676221, 70171, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not religious but I like the simple way in which this image conveys faith and the way that faith, for some, is a regular part of their everyday lives.</td>', 'I''m not religious but I like the simple way in which this image conveys faith and the way that faith, for some, is a regular part of their everyday lives.', '2004-04-19 18:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(676222, 70126, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice strong shapes and composition.</td>', 'Nice strong shapes and composition.', '2004-04-19 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(676227, 69744, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the high contrast black and white treatment of the image. And also the content itself - this is a well thought out interpretation that really resonates with me and speaks to me of so many stories.</td>', 'Love the high contrast black and white treatment of the image. And also the content itself - this is a well thought out interpretation that really resonates with me and speaks to me of so many stories.', '2004-04-19 18:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(676228, 69231, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait of the strength of faith. Nice composition, nice choice of a black background. I like the way that the line between background and clothing is still defined. Great eye contact.</td>', 'A lovely portrait of the strength of faith. Nice composition, nice choice of a black background. I like the way that the line between background and clothing is still defined. Great eye contact.', '2004-04-19 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(676229, 69422, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image - I love the vivid colours and the effect of the low DOF on the background. I am not sure how strongly this meets the challenge but it''s certainly a striking image.</td>', 'A beautiful image - I love the vivid colours and the effect of the low DOF on the background. I am not sure how strongly this meets the challenge but it''s certainly a striking image.', '2004-04-19 18:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(676234, 69957, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! I have seen similar pictures of similar content with similar composition but this one has a different texture to it and I really like it.</td>', 'Lovely! I have seen similar pictures of similar content with similar composition but this one has a different texture to it and I really like it.', '2004-04-19 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(676235, 69915, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a great pier and a lovely portrait. Nice composition too with framing from the trees and an off-centre layout.</td>', 'Wow! What a great pier and a lovely portrait. Nice composition too with framing from the trees and an off-centre layout.', '2004-04-19 18:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(676238, 69056, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is but assuming it''s an engine or machine of some kind. Love shallow DOF and I think it works well here with the close up creating wonderful abstract curvy shapes.</td>', 'Not sure what this is but assuming it''s an engine or machine of some kind. Love shallow DOF and I think it works well here with the close up creating wonderful abstract curvy shapes.', '2004-04-19 18:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(676242, 69918, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely viewpoint. There are so very many pictures of the Eiffel Tower and yet you''ve shown me one that I hadn''t seen before with the inclusion of the signs and the tree to really add additional interest. Excellent!</td>', 'Lovely viewpoint. There are so very many pictures of the Eiffel Tower and yet you''ve shown me one that I hadn''t seen before with the inclusion of the signs and the tree to really add additional interest. Excellent!', '2004-04-19 18:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(676244, 69991, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely image - I like the slight pattern in the background - thrown out to just the right extent by the shallow DOF. I think the texture of rust and wear on the chain and padlock really adds interest. Your composition is unusual and works well for me.</td>', 'Lovely image - I like the slight pattern in the background - thrown out to just the right extent by the shallow DOF. I think the texture of rust and wear on the chain and padlock really adds interest. Your composition is unusual and works well for me.', '2004-04-19 18:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(676245, 70168, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, nice pose. Image seems a little soft though.</td>', 'Great lighting, nice pose. Image seems a little soft though.', '2004-04-19 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(676248, 69954, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an absolutely charming (and somewhat absurd) image. Such fun! Lighting is great and your choice to go black and white is just right. It''s nice to see someone crop to non-standard ratios. I often do (not that you''d notice from my few DPC entries) but I notice few tend to think of it. Works well here. Wonderful image!</td>', 'What an absolutely charming (and somewhat absurd) image. Such fun! Lighting is great and your choice to go black and white is just right. It''s nice to see someone crop to non-standard ratios. I often do (not that you''d notice from my few DPC entries) but I notice few tend to think of it. Works well here. Wonderful image!', '2004-04-19 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(676283, 70067, 11347, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the lighting.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the lighting.', '2004-04-19 18:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(676284, 69748, 11347, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Matches the theme perfectly.</td>', 'Great shot. Matches the theme perfectly.', '2004-04-19 18:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(676287, 70092, 19333, '<td valign="top">a little too tight the crop for me</td>', 'a little too tight the crop for me', '2004-04-19 18:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(676288, 69915, 11347, '<td valign="top">Probably my favorite. A Fantastic shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Probably my favorite. A Fantastic shot. Nice work.', '2004-04-19 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(676289, 69994, 19333, '<td valign="top">you were supposed to protrait sthength, not the lack of it! :)</td>', 'you were supposed to protrait sthength, not the lack of it! :)', '2004-04-19 18:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(676290, 69043, 11347, '<td valign="top">heh cute.</td>', 'heh cute.', '2004-04-19 18:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
