(676330, 69485, 19333, '<td valign="top">What size is it actually? I guess it''s pretty big.<br/>lightning is too dark at both hands/ right arm, you can''t see the details</td>', 'What size is it actually? I guess it''s pretty big.lightning is too dark at both hands/ right arm, you can''t see the details', '2004-04-19 19:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(676333, 69911, 17610, '<td valign="top">Being as I am totally disgusted with the human race, I guess I like the subject of this photo.  Yes, it shows great strength.  But even bigger weakness.  Human weakness, their obsession with reaching bigger and better and more destructive technology.  It is pathetic the way the whole human race has been so greedy that they''ve become blind to the fact that they are killing their own race.  Themselves.  Complete stupidity!</td>', 'Being as I am totally disgusted with the human race, I guess I like the subject of this photo.  Yes, it shows great strength.  But even bigger weakness.  Human weakness, their obsession with reaching bigger and better and more destructive technology.  It is pathetic the way the whole human race has been so greedy that they''ve become blind to the fact that they are killing their own race.  Themselves.  Complete stupidity!', '2004-04-19 19:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(676335, 70145, 19333, '<td valign="top">I guess they don''t! What did happen?</td>', 'I guess they don''t! What did happen?', '2004-04-19 19:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(676337, 70194, 19333, '<td valign="top">For me, the whole hand should be visible.</td>', 'For me, the whole hand should be visible.', '2004-04-19 19:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(676344, 70156, 19333, '<td valign="top">I''d rather used "PowerFULL" for the title. ;)<br/>Not sure if BW does good, I think it will be stonger in color.</td>', 'I''d rather used "PowerFULL" for the title. ;)Not sure if BW does good, I think it will be stonger in color.', '2004-04-19 19:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(676351, 69609, 19333, '<td valign="top">Is he playing sumo? ;-)<br/> <br/>Nice portrait, a little more "strength face" and looking ahead could help, but I know by own experience how difficult is the kids to do &lt;b&gt;what&lt;/b&gt; you want them to &lt;b&gt;when&lt;/b&gt; you want them to. I had imagined something similar to this one, but the kid didn''t want to pose :(<br/> <br/>the objects in the background are distacting, even more the one which appears to be getting out the child''s head.</td>', 'Is he playing sumo? ;-) Nice portrait, a little more "strength face" and looking ahead could help, but I know by own experience how difficult is the kids to do <b>what</b> you want them to <b>when</b> you want them to. I had imagined something similar to this one, but the kid didn''t want to pose :( the objects in the background are distacting, even more the one which appears to be getting out the child''s head.', '2004-04-19 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(676352, 69953, 19333, '<td valign="top">pretty strong you''re, don''t you!!  ;)</td>', 'pretty strong you''re, don''t you!!  ;)', '2004-04-19 19:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
