(676423, 69911, 7778, '<td valign="top">The lengthly, explanatory title would make a useful comment in the ''Details'' box provided under the image. As a title, it is, IMO, distracting and, unfortunately, de-mystifying the image. A great find and worthy subject though.</td>', 'The lengthly, explanatory title would make a useful comment in the ''Details'' box provided under the image. As a title, it is, IMO, distracting and, unfortunately, de-mystifying the image. A great find and worthy subject though.', '2004-04-19 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
