(676524, 69896, 6008, '<td valign="top">If I''m seeing what I think I''m seeing then this is far too deep for DPC! A very interesting and almost surreal image. Nicely captured smoke too. Very thought-provoking.</td>', 'If I''m seeing what I think I''m seeing then this is far too deep for DPC! A very interesting and almost surreal image. Nicely captured smoke too. Very thought-provoking.', '2004-04-19 21:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
