(676677, 69725, 13728, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I would have liked this better if cropped vertically.  There is too much space on the sides and it takes away from the interest of the picture.  Also moving him a little further away from the wall ould have eliminated some of the harsh shadows</td>', 'Cute.  I would have liked this better if cropped vertically.  There is too much space on the sides and it takes away from the interest of the picture.  Also moving him a little further away from the wall ould have eliminated some of the harsh shadows', '2004-04-20 00:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
