(676870, 70123, 20430, '<td valign="top">Excellent work - where is it may I ask?  Did you play with the WB at all or was this the first attempt?  And what could the black spot left hand side be?</td>', 'Excellent work - where is it may I ask?  Did you play with the WB at all or was this the first attempt?  And what could the black spot left hand side be?', '2004-04-20 03:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
