(676915, 69982, 3765, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of the wide angle. Composition is fine. Perhaps the contrast is slightly too steep. Might also be a matter of taste. Very good. 9</td>', 'Wonderful use of the wide angle. Composition is fine. Perhaps the contrast is slightly too steep. Might also be a matter of taste. Very good. 9', '2004-04-20 04:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(676916, 69501, 3765, '<td valign="top">No, I wouldn''t mess with this guy. Good compostion overall. Pity the eyes are in the shadows. Fill-in flash might have worked but perhaps you had to keep your distance. Good luck. 8</td>', 'No, I wouldn''t mess with this guy. Good compostion overall. Pity the eyes are in the shadows. Fill-in flash might have worked but perhaps you had to keep your distance. Good luck. 8', '2004-04-20 05:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
