(676937, 69853, 19333, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion.</td>', 'Great sense of motion.', '2004-04-20 05:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(676967, 70177, 15919, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is fine to express the spirit of the image and I like how the trees bends or curves in parallel to the gyu.  But it seems a litle underexposed and the colorsaturation isnt very strong.<br/>It´s an ok image but why have it so small?</td>', 'The soft focus is fine to express the spirit of the image and I like how the trees bends or curves in parallel to the gyu.  But it seems a litle underexposed and the colorsaturation isnt very strong.It´s an ok image but why have it so small?', '2004-04-20 06:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(676968, 70161, 15919, '<td valign="top">It´s a very good idea to try to express the strength and power of the nature forces.  But in this case I find it poorly performed.  The colors are dull, it lacks sharpness and better focus and I think you need some other angel.</td>', 'It´s a very good idea to try to express the strength and power of the nature forces.  But in this case I find it poorly performed.  The colors are dull, it lacks sharpness and better focus and I think you need some other angel.', '2004-04-20 06:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
