(677451, 69231, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  The only think I see to make it significantly better is to crop it tighter on the right.  I would have also liked to have seen more light on her eyes, such as a small pen-light (not aimed at her) to give a small light to catch in her eyes.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  The only think I see to make it significantly better is to crop it tighter on the right.  I would have also liked to have seen more light on her eyes, such as a small pen-light (not aimed at her) to give a small light to catch in her eyes.', '2004-04-20 14:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(677457, 70196, 18722, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you had not cropped off the bottom, left and top.</td>', 'Perhaps if you had not cropped off the bottom, left and top.', '2004-04-20 14:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
