(677895, 70123, 16488, '<td valign="top">There are so many right things about this photo!  The light is right, the cropping, the movement, lighting, must I go on!  Hope you make it to the top!</td>', 'There are so many right things about this photo!  The light is right, the cropping, the movement, lighting, must I go on!  Hope you make it to the top!', '2004-04-20 20:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(677900, 69761, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a subtle intensity!  The side lighting and cropping seem to make this (typical?) infant pose something much more.  More focus on the fist would have helped bring out the whole concept a little more.   The model''s a keeper!  Best of luck!</td>', 'What a subtle intensity!  The side lighting and cropping seem to make this (typical?) infant pose something much more.  More focus on the fist would have helped bring out the whole concept a little more.   The model''s a keeper!  Best of luck!', '2004-04-20 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(677910, 69768, 16488, '<td valign="top">When I asked my friends and family for a subject for this challenge this is the one they chose.  I couldn''t get to where there was one, so thank you!  I''ll point them here.<br/> <br/>Photographically speaking, I don''t feel the tipped angle of the tree trunk supports the theme so well.  And, for me, the use of sepia tone detracts--I wonder did the subject need that treatment?  Contrast, focus, crop,--right on as far as I''m concerned.  Luck</td>', 'When I asked my friends and family for a subject for this challenge this is the one they chose.  I couldn''t get to where there was one, so thank you!  I''ll point them here. Photographically speaking, I don''t feel the tipped angle of the tree trunk supports the theme so well.  And, for me, the use of sepia tone detracts--I wonder did the subject need that treatment?  Contrast, focus, crop,--right on as far as I''m concerned.  Luck', '2004-04-20 20:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(677912, 69853, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Both strength and power represented here.  If just something or someone was crisply in focus this would get my highest mark.  Difficult lighting, perhapse that causes the bright, bright lights on the uniforms?  Hope you can do it again with even better results than the first.</td>', 'Nice capture!  Both strength and power represented here.  If just something or someone was crisply in focus this would get my highest mark.  Difficult lighting, perhapse that causes the bright, bright lights on the uniforms?  Hope you can do it again with even better results than the first.', '2004-04-20 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(677916, 69306, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  The converging vertical lines are great and black and white works perfectly.</td>', 'I love this picture.  The converging vertical lines are great and black and white works perfectly.', '2004-04-20 20:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(677919, 69480, 18274, '<td valign="top">nice tits! very thought provoking<br/></td>', 'nice tits! very thought provoking', '2004-04-20 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(677923, 69612, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but without the title it really doesn''t say strength to me.</td>', 'I like the shot, but without the title it really doesn''t say strength to me.', '2004-04-20 20:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(677933, 69853, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is certainly the best demonstration of strength of those photos I have voted on so far.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is certainly the best demonstration of strength of those photos I have voted on so far.  Good luck.', '2004-04-20 20:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(677941, 69728, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the strength is really in the title, not the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the strength is really in the title, not the photo.', '2004-04-20 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(677952, 69754, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  This is really good.</td>', 'Great angle.  This is really good.', '2004-04-20 21:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(677954, 70063, 12160, '<td valign="top">lol ...i see power</td>', 'lol ...i see power', '2004-04-20 21:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(677962, 70123, 772, '<td valign="top">Every now and then, I come across a photo that speaks, and this is one of them.  Strength dominates this image, as mother nature is full of incredible forces.  Man is not even a challenge for the strength of nature.  The diminuitive size of the man in this photo accents that theme quite well.  This is a GREAT shot.<br/> <br/>I''m trying to get away from commenting on technicals/technique, but this photo begs me to ask a question and make a suggestion as well.  I don''t know if this is just a candid shot of this man, but IF this person is posed for you in this scene, why did you choose to have him facing to the left rather than facing and looking up at/into the waterfall?  Personally, I think this would make it even stronger.  <br/> <br/>Regardless, this is my ''best of show'' in this challenge... Kudos on a great shot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Every now and then, I come across a photo that speaks, and this is one of them.  Strength dominates this image, as mother nature is full of incredible forces.  Man is not even a challenge for the strength of nature.  The diminuitive size of the man in this photo accents that theme quite well.  This is a GREAT shot. I''m trying to get away from commenting on technicals/technique, but this photo begs me to ask a question and make a suggestion as well.  I don''t know if this is just a candid shot of this man, but IF this person is posed for you in this scene, why did you choose to have him facing to the left rather than facing and looking up at/into the waterfall?  Personally, I think this would make it even stronger.   Regardless, this is my ''best of show'' in this challenge... Kudos on a great shot. ', '2004-04-20 21:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(677970, 70088, 20419, '<td valign="top">I like the concept/subject matter, but the overall image might be a little too "clean" for me in specific regard  to what''s in it (unless you were going for more of a "this is just a bit of innocent white powder" look).  I definitely think I would have liked it more on a scratched/filty mirror or piece of broken glass, slightly underexposed, grainy, not quite as zoomed in/less cropping, etc, but that''s just me.  The photo on a technical level looks fine to me, however, and I applaud you for even posting such a thing at all.  Nice work (I gave it a 7).</td>', 'I like the concept/subject matter, but the overall image might be a little too "clean" for me in specific regard  to what''s in it (unless you were going for more of a "this is just a bit of innocent white powder" look).  I definitely think I would have liked it more on a scratched/filty mirror or piece of broken glass, slightly underexposed, grainy, not quite as zoomed in/less cropping, etc, but that''s just me.  The photo on a technical level looks fine to me, however, and I applaud you for even posting such a thing at all.  Nice work (I gave it a 7).', '2004-04-20 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(677971, 69761, 2158, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2004-04-20 21:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
