(677997, 69999, 20419, '<td valign="top">Very impressive composition.  Leaving the face out was a good decision in representing the power of the culture that made it (if that was your intention, as I believe it was), and not the personage of the sculpture.  Also, B&amp;W here definitely brings it to me.  Nothing I see to nitpick here.</td>', 'Very impressive composition.  Leaving the face out was a good decision in representing the power of the culture that made it (if that was your intention, as I believe it was), and not the personage of the sculpture.  Also, B&W here definitely brings it to me.  Nothing I see to nitpick here.', '2004-04-20 22:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
