(678633, 70123, 1368, '<td valign="top">Mamma mía!! A blue ribbon! And a second ribbon in a week! wow! Thank you all for commenting and scoring! Wish I could have cleaned out that sensor dust, But I couldnt :) Didnt want to crop the black part of it either, And I have outtakes where I have the model looking up in the waterfall But on that picture the waterfall looked blurry, So I chose this one. Thanks again! I´m gonna have a bottle of Lýsi to celebrate! :D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-21 01:35:23.</i></td>', 'Mamma mía!! A blue ribbon! And a second ribbon in a week! wow! Thank you all for commenting and scoring! Wish I could have cleaned out that sensor dust, But I couldnt :) Didnt want to crop the black part of it either, And I have outtakes where I have the model looking up in the waterfall But on that picture the waterfall looked blurry, So I chose this one. Thanks again! I´m gonna have a bottle of Lýsi to celebrate! :D', '2004-04-21 02:33:04.000000', '2004-04-21 02:35:23.000000', 0),
