(678776, 69957, 12252, '<td valign="top">I wish I''d had a better title to convey my intentions in this image. I found that the macro demonstrated strength and power at the cellular level. My other titles included things like "The Power of Teamwork -- Every Cell Pulls It''s Weight," and things of that nature. I was delighted with the comments I received and glad that a few folks even saw the connection to the theme!</td>', 'I wish I''d had a better title to convey my intentions in this image. I found that the macro demonstrated strength and power at the cellular level. My other titles included things like "The Power of Teamwork -- Every Cell Pulls It''s Weight," and things of that nature. I was delighted with the comments I received and glad that a few folks even saw the connection to the theme!', '2004-04-21 05:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(678797, 69466, 16907, '<td valign="top">I can see that bunch of ppl had the same idea, but you delivered and that''s what counts! Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I can see that bunch of ppl had the same idea, but you delivered and that''s what counts! Congrats on the ribbon!', '2004-04-21 05:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
