(679017, 70187, 16430, '<td valign="top">Obviously, a few folks thought I was only showing the ends of a huge horseshoe magnet, but that is not the case. You are seeing two magnets that attached themselves to a metal bar, which was hung from a ladder. You can barely see the lines of the metal bar in the photo. These are fairly small, but powerful magnets. Anyway, thanks to all for your great comments and votes.</td>', 'Obviously, a few folks thought I was only showing the ends of a huge horseshoe magnet, but that is not the case. You are seeing two magnets that attached themselves to a metal bar, which was hung from a ladder. You can barely see the lines of the metal bar in the photo. These are fairly small, but powerful magnets. Anyway, thanks to all for your great comments and votes.', '2004-04-21 08:27:15.000000', NULL, 0),
