(679071, 69738, 16636, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the votes. <br/> <br/>This is my eldest daughter Amy who is 5. Got the idea when both my daughters started having a ''tug-of-war'' comp in the garden. It took an absolute age to get her to only pull and not sway from side to side. Got the shot from my new camera (only 1 day old)and I am so pleased with it - definately it will adorn the walls of our home with pride.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for all the constructive comments</td>', 'Thanks for all the votes.  This is my eldest daughter Amy who is 5. Got the idea when both my daughters started having a ''tug-of-war'' comp in the garden. It took an absolute age to get her to only pull and not sway from side to side. Got the shot from my new camera (only 1 day old)and I am so pleased with it - definately it will adorn the walls of our home with pride. Thanks again for all the constructive comments', '2004-04-21 09:02:13.000000', NULL, 0),
