(679180, 69231, 14386, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot! Personally, this is my all-time favorite among all my shots and I am glad a lot of you like it too. Well, I guess I ruffled some religious feathers but frankly speaking, that was not my intention. <br/> <br/>I took this shot during the Holy Week. Katrina is a god daughter and she agreed to be a model for me. She''s a very beautiful girl so I think this won''t be the last you will see of her here. :)<br/> <br/>I wish those 8 who gave me a 1 left some comments. Well, it doesn''t really matter for me now but if you want to PM me, you are most welcomed. <br/> <br/>Once again, THANK you very much. <br/> <br/>bruchen and arbil14, I will send you this picture in postcard form if you can guess which one is my Silhouette challenge shot. :)<br/> <br/>God bless everyone.<br/></td>', 'Thanks a lot! Personally, this is my all-time favorite among all my shots and I am glad a lot of you like it too. Well, I guess I ruffled some religious feathers but frankly speaking, that was not my intention.  I took this shot during the Holy Week. Katrina is a god daughter and she agreed to be a model for me. She''s a very beautiful girl so I think this won''t be the last you will see of her here. :) I wish those 8 who gave me a 1 left some comments. Well, it doesn''t really matter for me now but if you want to PM me, you are most welcomed.  Once again, THANK you very much.  bruchen and arbil14, I will send you this picture in postcard form if you can guess which one is my Silhouette challenge shot. :) God bless everyone.', '2004-04-21 10:24:48.000000', NULL, 0),
