(679532, 69962, 19977, '<td valign="top">Maybe an explanation? The strength is found in the stone, not in the branches. Besides, in some aspects, growing plants are stronger then stone. The focus is on the fracture and part of the stone. The rest of the photo is less important and so I let it out of focus. I understand now that this didn''t work at all. I hope this will teach me a lesson. Thanks for all your comments.</td>', 'Maybe an explanation? The strength is found in the stone, not in the branches. Besides, in some aspects, growing plants are stronger then stone. The focus is on the fracture and part of the stone. The rest of the photo is less important and so I let it out of focus. I understand now that this didn''t work at all. I hope this will teach me a lesson. Thanks for all your comments.', '2004-04-21 13:44:15.000000', NULL, 0),
