(680133, 69896, 18719, '<td valign="top">i had alot of fun taking this pic. the turkey in the background is smoking and the egg in the ash trey with a baby ribbon on its head to symbolize smoking having the strength to harm unborn babies. also the chicken symbolizes quiting cold turkey.ash tray could be the baby cradle also but dosnt need to symolize that. every image has a purpose. anti smoking. thanks to all who gave me feed back!!  good times!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-21 18:38:43.</i></td>', 'i had alot of fun taking this pic. the turkey in the background is smoking and the egg in the ash trey with a baby ribbon on its head to symbolize smoking having the strength to harm unborn babies. also the chicken symbolizes quiting cold turkey.ash tray could be the baby cradle also but dosnt need to symolize that. every image has a purpose. anti smoking. thanks to all who gave me feed back!!  good times!!', '2004-04-21 19:36:45.000000', '2004-04-21 19:38:43.000000', 0),
