(680810, 70197, 17802, '<td valign="top">Thank you all.  To answer, no foot inside and I cooked the egg just in case.  I would have liked to put the egg on end but was limited w/ where I could do this and all of the smoke and mirrors :( Also, the composition wasn''t working for me at the time.  I know this is one of my better shots (but I see a lot more flaws in it - an artist is his own worse critic)<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thank you all.  To answer, no foot inside and I cooked the egg just in case.  I would have liked to put the egg on end but was limited w/ where I could do this and all of the smoke and mirrors :( Also, the composition wasn''t working for me at the time.  I know this is one of my better shots (but I see a lot more flaws in it - an artist is his own worse critic) Thanks again!', '2004-04-22 03:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
