(680920, 70170, 5585, '<td valign="top">as I said in a previous comment..Good photo.. your Idea was depicted..very well... and the photo should have scored a point or more higher on average..shown by the 98 voters who scored it 5 or above..the experience I have had on this Site has made me a better photographer...with each challenge..good or bad finish..gives me the initiative..to do better...regardless of the outcome...return to the next challenge..with your same work ethic..and you will be surprised...by the way...lol... your photo really wasn''t a "4"</td>', 'as I said in a previous comment..Good photo.. your Idea was depicted..very well... and the photo should have scored a point or more higher on average..shown by the 98 voters who scored it 5 or above..the experience I have had on this Site has made me a better photographer...with each challenge..good or bad finish..gives me the initiative..to do better...regardless of the outcome...return to the next challenge..with your same work ethic..and you will be surprised...by the way...lol... your photo really wasn''t a "4"', '2004-04-22 05:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
