(768312, 70145, 19025, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i> Why is the book tilted? Cool idea. Out of the box, for strength. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am sure the book is tilted because not all eggs are the same size. I think it is a remarkable picture and very creative. Feel free to take a look at some of my art and photography at the following website.<br/><a href="//photos.yahoo.com/wilkinsonartwork" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//photos.yahoo.com/wilkinsonartwork</a> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Zoomdak: Why is the book tilted? Cool idea. Out of the box, for strength.   I am sure the book is tilted because not all eggs are the same size. I think it is a remarkable picture and very creative. Feel free to take a look at some of my art and photography at the following website.//photos.yahoo.com/wilkinsonartwork ', '2004-06-18 04:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(779807, 69951, 14656, '<td valign="top">I just happened to be browsing my comments that others found helpful and couldn''t help but notice this one again. Was this photo/entry really your work? The title and photo seem so out of place in your portfolio, especially for someone who has earned 5 ribbons! The quality of your other photos are phenomenal but this appears as if it were taken by your son or daughter.</td>', 'I just happened to be browsing my comments that others found helpful and couldn''t help but notice this one again. Was this photo/entry really your work? The title and photo seem so out of place in your portfolio, especially for someone who has earned 5 ribbons! The quality of your other photos are phenomenal but this appears as if it were taken by your son or daughter.', '2004-06-25 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
